<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN" data-site-prefix="../" data-page-kind="topic"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>图像回收：操作与最后读者 · 架构逆向与实现对照文档</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/542ae2d5e2de76f7a482e81bed7afe56395d5076e55bb540bec24f2862bef6e9.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/2d6f64a41592ecc5580f5c9af7df50312d13003a44b11a009e97a399d0f450fe.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/0406149be904073c2ce7f9c463de30c838a7e631d14c8d5bb6a37504503d377b.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/803029919eed32de8e6b562de1110670aa54f8c208a24d221e5d9aec09164500.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/d5fece9265f8ae702d5f7a43c7726a744c7ed184259f0e2cb8a9cfd1cef19b94.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/2da1f7cfd40bdcb9d85e54468d109c375ebeade01cfe9c94372762f7bb9200ed.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/e0aa4d2e552f0df112cd943bd3ba39229da3836f54211ecabd618e977dfa3702.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/site.css"></head><body><a class="site-skip" href="#main-content">跳到正文</a><header class="site-header"><nav aria-label="主导航"><a href="../index.html">首页／界面入口</a><a href="../主题/主界面入口.html">主界面</a><a href="../工具/index.html">工具窗口</a><a href="../数据/index.html">数据与 Owner</a><a href="../主题/执行与状态.html">执行与结果</a><a href="../清单/交付与兼容.html">范围／兼容</a></nav><p class="breadcrumb">架构逆向与实现对照文档 / 图像回收：操作与最后读者</p><h1>图像回收：操作与最后读者</h1><p class="muted">原版事实、当前独立实现、拟议设计与未知分别保留。导航示意属于文档组织，不代表原程序的控件树或完整运行验证。</p><p id="route-message" role="status" hidden></p></header><main id="main-content" class="site-main"><p class="site-notice">本页正文与分类来自拆分前页面。长原文已迁移到内容寻址证据页，原始 SHA 和返回路径仍保留。</p><div class="source-content"><section id="retirement-operation-map"><h4>五种结束操作：谁先退出，谁还持有？</h4><p>先看你做了哪个操作，再看它实际清了什么。<strong>停止 ≠ 清结果；清结果 ≠ 清缓存；清缓存 ≠ 最后一份像素已释放。</strong></p><p>这是按用户操作整理的证据上下文，不是把所列成员串成同一活实例调用链。已确认的字段/容器变化与未知的最后读者明确分开。</p><details data-retirement-operation="stop"><summary>① 点击停止：画面没动，是不是还在运行？</summary><div class="dd-stage-columns"><article data-retirement-side="original"><h4>原版：已证片段与未知父级桥</h4><p><strong>停止入口先改执行控制；此处没有证明显示仓库或图像缓存被清空。</strong></p><p><strong>谁持有：</strong>原版全局连续标志、逐流程连续标志、显示仓库和图像载荷是不同责任。</p><p><strong>已确认的收尾：</strong>StopRun直接请求停止；全局脚本停止、逐流程停止与属性通知有具体调用顺序和异常分支。</p><p><strong>此后仍可能存在：</strong>这些停止体不能证明回调已排空、所有查询容器已释放或最后像素读者已退出。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：停止请求到同一帧生产者、回调和显示消费者全部退出的完整链仍未取得。</p><details><summary>逐段展开成员、分支与源码</summary><details data-retirement-proof="Q01"><summary>Q01 · MutiRun / CheckRun / StopRun → 状态检查或直接停止 → MutiOrStopRun(bool)</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>MutiRun在CheckRun放行后传true并记日志；CheckRun只拒绝首个WorkState非Ready且IsEnabled的流程。StopRun不走CheckRun，直接传false。MutiRun catch仅对VmException显示全局脚本错误，其它异常无该提示；StopRun没有此catch。</p><details><summary>continuous and stop wrappers</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="269a712429fb8ae3d5218bd0466e2b8c83dace6b2071f951ffd90ba698386018" href="../../证据/269a712429fb8ae3d5218bd0466e2b8c83dace6b2071f951ffd90ba698386018.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>269a712429fb</small></a></details><details><summary>VisionMaster.AppMainWindow.TitleMenueItemData::MutiRun</summary><p>42e2437780ec21c9d1ade2d07ace0a26635961f5c90559934a7fde7e233e0c23 / MVID 77c739a5-b0ec-4834-8a1e-64dd9b618ae5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="01b73eb5df56f03ea0368cb1cbe288ac53793e1e84413d3829a4dc79c6aa5f65" href="../../证据/01b73eb5df56f03ea0368cb1cbe288ac53793e1e84413d3829a4dc79c6aa5f65.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>01b73eb5df56</small></a></details><details><summary>VisionMaster.AppMainWindow.TitleMenueItemData::CheckRun</summary><p>42e2437780ec21c9d1ade2d07ace0a26635961f5c90559934a7fde7e233e0c23 / MVID 77c739a5-b0ec-4834-8a1e-64dd9b618ae5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d41a7f4e7dcd9071154a3b0020f90cb6174274a7f2ee833fa8e1e0f511c975dc" href="../../证据/d41a7f4e7dcd9071154a3b0020f90cb6174274a7f2ee833fa8e1e0f511c975dc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d41a7f4e7dcd</small></a></details><details><summary>VisionMaster.AppMainWindow.TitleMenueItemData::MutiOrStopRun</summary><p>42e2437780ec21c9d1ade2d07ace0a26635961f5c90559934a7fde7e233e0c23 / MVID 77c739a5-b0ec-4834-8a1e-64dd9b618ae5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="02fa9fcf4cfd169cdbbee15477325f99e5639682ef704308f703c0749dec206e" href="../../证据/02fa9fcf4cfd169cdbbee15477325f99e5639682ef704308f703c0749dec206e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>02fa9fcf4cfd</small></a></details><details><summary>VisionMaster.AppMainWindow.TitleMenueItemData::StopRun</summary><p>42e2437780ec21c9d1ade2d07ace0a26635961f5c90559934a7fde7e233e0c23 / MVID 77c739a5-b0ec-4834-8a1e-64dd9b618ae5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="261c4f1911815910500afc3f16f80870a62c90da5e19276fc48a62cb4d87f7eb" href="../../证据/261c4f1911815910500afc3f16f80870a62c90da5e19276fc48a62cb4d87f7eb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>261c4f191181</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：外层反射吞异常、全部运行前提和实际完成另查。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="Q02"><summary>Q02 · VmSolution.ContinuousRunEnable setter → 全局脚本门 / false时清自执行并逐流程停止</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>若GloalScriptContinusRunEnable!=value先设置它。false时还设置IsContinuousSelfExecute=false，并遍历Modules.OfType&lt;VmProcedure>赋ContinuousRunEnable=false；true支路没有对应逐流程true赋值。不把全局连续开始简化成逐流程Start。</p><details><summary>VM.Core.VmSolution::set_ContinuousRunEnable</summary><p>936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d88d4d7b3a13014fe5bab09a83a165446977a6d958faafae32885c3a49523c88" href="../../证据/d88d4d7b3a13014fe5bab09a83a165446977a6d958faafae32885c3a49523c88.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d88d4d7b3a13</small></a></details><details><summary>.&lt;>c__DisplayClass70_0::&lt;set_ContinuousRunEnable>b__0</summary><p>936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="487238f5e02a4f957fd031811c8bc9661177b64fee8539703c0690c32ef2a26e" href="../../证据/487238f5e02a4f957fd031811c8bc9661177b64fee8539703c0690c32ef2a26e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>487238f5e02a</small></a></details><details><summary>solution continuous branches</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5afda26dfe6d5847ca484c4d2ef4e4d3771faa4da5210cc73113365164fb8edd" href="../../证据/5afda26dfe6d5847ca484c4d2ef4e4d3771faa4da5210cc73113365164fb8edd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5afda26dfe6d</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：自执行接口setter和全局脚本到流程调度未在此CIL范围全部恢复；非原子批次。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="Q03"><summary>Q03 · GloalScriptContinusRunEnable setter → SDK脚本开始/停止 → 状态字典/字段/流程标志/通知</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>同值直接返回。true先GlobalScriptStartContinueRun再按流程ID重置/加入dictProcessIDStopStatus；false先GlobalScriptStopRun再清字典。之后才写字段、逐流程IsGlobalRuning=value并通知三个属性。SDK异常发生在字段写入前，不能画成失败也必更新标志。</p><details><summary>VM.Core.VmSolution::set_GloalScriptContinusRunEnable</summary><p>936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7afe043e7f36f737f773f906c6d6146cc3a3149b61e167ccf56bce70af3c3197" href="../../证据/7afe043e7f36f737f773f906c6d6146cc3a3149b61e167ccf56bce70af3c3197.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7afe043e7f36</small></a></details><details><summary>.&lt;>c__DisplayClass73_0::&lt;set_GloalScriptContinusRunEnable>b__0</summary><p>936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1076d4b7d795ddf1413bb6962e0ee0f0f2b9579716e755a76dcc6ad4392140b4" href="../../证据/1076d4b7d795ddf1413bb6962e0ee0f0f2b9579716e755a76dcc6ad4392140b4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1076d4b7d795</small></a></details><details><summary>VM.PlatformSDKCS.GlobalModuleManager::GlobalScriptStartContinueRun</summary><p>34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dd85249fc450dac5b744d5573a162a545b62a74dc984edd3fcec1dc4affc0c9e" href="../../证据/dd85249fc450dac5b744d5573a162a545b62a74dc984edd3fcec1dc4affc0c9e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dd85249fc450</small></a></details><details><summary>VM.PlatformSDKCS.GlobalModuleManager::GlobalScriptStopRun</summary><p>34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="271769f2bcea07462e51281fd1db2a7dc3e4baa8443282b8bbc8b9a2c8738f37" href="../../证据/271769f2bcea07462e51281fd1db2a7dc3e4baa8443282b8bbc8b9a2c8738f37.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>271769f2bcea</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：所选SDK管理方法非零抛VmException；native状态、执行回调和通知异常恢复未知。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="Q04"><summary>Q04 · VmProcedure.ContinuousRunEnable setter → 先SDK开始/等待停止，再按变化更新缓存与父通知</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>true调ContinousRunStart(ID)，false调RefreshUIStopExecute(ID)，之后才判断缓存!=value决定SetProperty和父通知。因此重复false也会进入所选停止路径，不是同值即跳过SDK。</p><details><summary>VM.Core.VmProcedure::set_ContinuousRunEnable</summary><p>936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="29e2ed5a4dce9b16641c4d90cde7f7eea52a9d6e18dec4e5500af55938f07eb4" href="../../证据/29e2ed5a4dce9b16641c4d90cde7f7eea52a9d6e18dec4e5500af55938f07eb4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>29e2ed5a4dce</small></a></details><details><summary>procedure continuous ordering</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c6b1c9dbaae9c5b4782bd844b94e8af2c8feeada9cb64852b7cf5ce37ca1f795" href="../../证据/c6b1c9dbaae9c5b4782bd844b94e8af2c8feeada9cb64852b7cf5ce37ca1f795.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c6b1c9dbaae9</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：Parent为空、通知异常或前一步停止失败后的剩余流程状态未证回滚。</p></details></details></article><article data-retirement-side="current"><h4>当前：独立实现</h4><p><strong>停止是取消请求；结果保留取决于本轮是否返回了session。</strong></p><p><strong>谁持有：</strong>完整结果由workflowSessions持有，可见results只是另一份索引；scope状态与图像FIFO另外持有。</p><p><strong>已确认的收尾：</strong>取消抛出且没有返回session时，不自动用空结果覆盖旧session；若正常返回Cancelled/Failed session，可由本轮记录覆盖旧session。</p><p><strong>此后仍可能存在：</strong>本轮成功前缀的图像仍可能留在返回session中；停止并不清scope缓存。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：这不是原版停止协议的等价证明，也没有测量最后一份像素何时被GC回收。</p><details><summary>逐段展开成员、分支与源码</summary><details data-retirement-proof="CR01"><summary>CR01 · 新一轮开始 / 停止 / 抛取消异常 → 隐藏旧结果视图与保存旧会话是两个动作</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>BeginWorkflowResults增加过程执行计数，仅在count>1、workStatus非0且清旧结果偏好开启时，标记该过程及所调用子过程为cleared并清当前results视图；它不删除workflowSessions。RunCore返回session才StoreWorkflowCallResults覆盖对应会话并移除cleared标记。若Task.Run被取消或执行抛异常而没有返回session，catch只改状态文字，旧session仍在；偏好开启时可处于隐藏状态，未开启时也未由这个catch主动清除。工具栏停止只Cancel activeRun，FinishWorkflowRun清运行标记并Dispose该取消源，不清会话或插件scope状态。</p><p>representation：results是可见NodeRunRecord索引，workflowSessions是完整ExecutionSessionResult；隐藏索引不等于移除图像持有者。</p><p>cache：旧session可继续保持Nodes、WorkflowOutputs、WorkflowDisplays、LocalVariables和Calls中的PortValue引用；不能将空白显示当零像素缓存。</p><p>release：停止请求不等于清旧结果或FIFO；本轮没有新session时不会自动用空session覆盖旧session。</p><details><summary> void BeginWorkflowResults(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="906d7cf57bdf8339ab5ca2514f2fba86c6ae18a05d1a7b4e33387608010c9e52" href="../../证据/906d7cf57bdf8339ab5ca2514f2fba86c6ae18a05d1a7b4e33387608010c9e52.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>906d7cf57bdf</small></a></details><details><summary>    public bool ShouldClearAtBegin(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="57dd650ccb3cd900f30c8d8be2152928f992a15bc6916d26e3ec9cbc815dda73" href="../../证据/57dd650ccb3cd900f30c8d8be2152928f992a15bc6916d26e3ec9cbc815dda73.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>57dd650ccb3c</small></a></details><details><summary>   var session=await Task.Run(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5c3a2427db92b4e91b947080e765d7eee6df18eb8f50cf3ae982e9f778a08c69" href="../../证据/5c3a2427db92b4e91b947080e765d7eee6df18eb8f50cf3ae982e9f778a08c69.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5c3a2427db92</small></a></details><details><summary>  catch(OperationCanceledException){if(IsCurrentExecutionOwner(owner))</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0f1bef6a5732fecdbfba501aa4508ca1daea445ecf4da78732bfd3248f5fd227" href="../../证据/0f1bef6a5732fecdbfba501aa4508ca1daea445ecf4da78732bfd3248f5fd227.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0f1bef6a5732</small></a></details><details><summary> void StoreWorkflowCallResults(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3b3117a036fd49cd57cfbbf2dd5f2f05538f7f2b735a5257fcf2c1b3bec49f1c" href="../../证据/3b3117a036fd49cd57cfbbf2dd5f2f05538f7f2b735a5257fcf2c1b3bec49f1c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3b3117a036fd</small></a></details><details><summary> void FinishWorkflowRun(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9dd56ae0fac7064eb4fb05031cb8171ca88a0b21718cf16a701e45bf8cba48aa" href="../../证据/9dd56ae0fac7064eb4fb05031cb8171ca88a0b21718cf16a701e45bf8cba48aa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9dd56ae0fac7</small></a></details><details><summary>stopToolButton=Tool(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="61a0f0198b10cfd38182295471ce9f343d73ba976360d21b616ee810a24b93e7" href="../../证据/61a0f0198b10cfd38182295471ce9f343d73ba976360d21b616ee810a24b93e7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>61a0f0198b10</small></a></details><details><summary>public sealed record ExecutionSessionResult(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a624e1107d0fc0939aaeebd75f8cf5259eab85a687e6877a8ebbffc7440706a7" href="../../证据/a624e1107d0fc0939aaeebd75f8cf5259eab85a687e6877a8ebbffc7440706a7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a624e1107d0f</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：此事实仅区分返回session与抛异常两条路径，不把所有取消都判成保留旧会话；返回Cancelled session的覆盖路径见CR02。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="CR02"><summary>CR02 · GraphExecutor本轮取消 / 失败 / 跳过 → 本轮混合结果可替换上轮会话；旧插件状态另留</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>GraphExecutor每轮新建records，不拿上一轮NodeRunRecord补失败节点。节点开始前发现取消会Record(Cancelled)且输出默认Empty；前驱失败或不可用会Record(Skipped)且输出Empty。单节点执行后取消/超时/异常与失败输出过滤按TD04生成本轮记录，已经成功完成的前序节点记录不因此统一清空。最终把全部本轮记录组成session，状态可为Cancelled/Failed/TimedOut。RunCore只检查owner、未以session成功作为发布前提，所以正常返回的取消/失败session也可替换workflowSessions，包含本轮早先成功节点图像与后续空输出。</p><p>representation：取消后保留的可能是本轮成功前缀，不是自动合并上一轮成功图像；失败记录与成功记录的图像持有不同。</p><p>cache：覆盖旧会话只移除该字典入口的旧引用，不清插件缓存、配置结果、调试记录或独立视图；新session本身仍可保留本轮成功图像。</p><p>release：清输出字典、返回取消状态、取消源Dispose均没有逐帧图像Dispose语义。</p><details><summary>  var calls=new Dictionary&lt;string,ExecutionSessionResult>();</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c7144a5f850927830edc406166c971f52e77b9968d6f6ea0aec41d31578cea76" href="../../证据/c7144a5f850927830edc406166c971f52e77b9968d6f6ea0aec41d31578cea76.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c7144a5f8509</small></a></details><details><summary>   void Record(NodeRunStatus s,</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f1440ee0600786c122f0d86ac78832d707143388f584c292c495a9f8eb204f54" href="../../证据/f1440ee0600786c122f0d86ac78832d707143388f584c292c495a9f8eb204f54.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f1440ee06007</small></a></details><details><summary>   if(executionEdges.Where(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="11cf5bf31a1b62f258250b166cff21ce3305c5ec960ca40048bbb592167d77bf" href="../../证据/11cf5bf31a1b62f258250b166cff21ce3305c5ec960ca40048bbb592167d77bf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>11cf5bf31a1b</small></a></details><details><summary>   if(cancellationToken.IsCancellationRequested){Record(NodeRunStatus.Cancelled,code:</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1edcf7aa0e18f242df1eb1159ae781bfbee4da1ae061d2377b257bd27a4c65a4" href="../../证据/1edcf7aa0e18f242df1eb1159ae781bfbee4da1ae061d2377b257bd27a4c65a4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1edcf7aa0e18</small></a></details><details><summary>  var all=validation.ExecutionOrder.Select(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f68913b1df0b35ac68aca5c58ab9b03e7c8a095b5fb0fd382db0189265a8ce1f" href="../../证据/f68913b1df0b35ac68aca5c58ab9b03e7c8a095b5fb0fd382db0189265a8ce1f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f68913b1df0b</small></a></details><details><summary>   WorkflowCallbacks.PublishModuleResult(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="267f0dc129d0e1d9039b2874b4463ef9adafd5a3a1001d76e3cd72a5e464bab6" href="../../证据/267f0dc129d0e1d9039b2874b4463ef9adafd5a3a1001d76e3cd72a5e464bab6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>267f0dc129d0</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：Task.Run调度前取消或外层异常可能不产生session，需与CR01分别判断；未执行竞争、GC或内存峰值探针。</p></details></details></article></div></details><details data-retirement-operation="config"><summary>② 关闭工具窗口：窗口没了，结果还在谁手里？</summary><div class="dd-stage-columns"><article data-retirement-side="original"><h4>原版：已证片段与未知父级桥</h4><p><strong>参数窗Closed只清窗口关联与ROI状态；结果宿主关闭是另一个入口。</strong></p><p><strong>谁持有：</strong>A链持有模块装饰器、结果仓库与选择图像；B链持有临时图像/图形仓库和控件属性。</p><p><strong>已确认的收尾：</strong>CurTabControlBase_Closed清窗口引用/Tag，置IsOpenParams=false并隐藏ROI，没有清ModuleSource。另行发生OwnerWin_Closed或装饰器Dispose才按对应宿主路径清显示；不能把它们当成同一次关闭的必经后续。</p><p><strong>此后仍可能存在：</strong>Unloaded退委托没有撤销此前Task.Run或Dispatcher委托；清仓库不等于生产者像素已归还。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：不同宿主的关闭路径不能拼成一个实例的统一释放协议；所有在飞工作和原生最后读者尚未闭合。</p><details><summary>逐段展开成员、分支与源码</summary><details data-retirement-proof="OR03"><summary>OR03 · 参数窗Closed → CurTabControlBase_Closed → 清窗引用/Tag，关闭参数与ROI状态</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>参数窗创建后以WeakEventManager登记Closed。Closed处理使用Dispatcher.Invoke把curTabControlBase置null；ROIPartUI若是ModuleResultView只把其Tag置null，随后IsOpenParams=false、SetRoiVisible(false)，再让Undo服务RemoveEmptyOperation。这个所见关闭尾部没有把ModuleSource或ImageDataSource置null，也没有调用ClearDataStore/Decorator.Dispose。关参数窗不能直接读成清除主界面图像/历史结果。</p><p>representation：参数窗口、ModuleResultView.Tag、参数打开标志与主图像来源分别持有；Tag原先登记参数窗，退出仅解除该关联。</p><p>cache：主显示是否保留图像应按各显示仓的已有证据判断，不由关闭配置操作概括。</p><p>release：本体解除窗口/Tag引用并改变ROI准入；未证明图像像素、结果或渲染任务已释放/排空。</p><details><summary>ProcedureConfigControl params window Closed registration</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="63ba9b45cd4a9537b1511ebea21413f332a068eff50fc77f15ec8292b857889e" href="../../证据/63ba9b45cd4a9537b1511ebea21413f332a068eff50fc77f15ec8292b857889e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>63ba9b45cd4a</small></a></details><details><summary>ProcedureConfigControl.CurTabControlBase_Closed</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="03f4e697f3ff834cc93c1fd93a401108af9c4ea401e5585bfdfc914da1d1e370" href="../../证据/03f4e697f3ff834cc93c1fd93a401108af9c4ea401e5585bfdfc914da1d1e370.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>03f4e697f3ff</small></a></details><details><summary>ProcedureConfigControl.SetRoiVisible</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="adedc9ccccfb12af6dea3a42651665fa115108e49ba43e1b8b72b98106fa9fbb" href="../../证据/adedc9ccccfb12af6dea3a42651665fa115108e49ba43e1b8b72b98106fa9fbb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>adedc9ccccfb</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：专用配置窗口内部Unloaded/DisposeFunction以及已排队的显示任务退出，必须按对应控件另核；本轮不扩为所有插件配置窗通用合同。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="RS05"><summary>RS05 · 模块切换 / OwnerWin_Closed / 装饰器Dispose → 清图像字段、退订事件、清缓存与原始像素寿命分列</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>OwnerWin_Closed把ModuleSource设null，普通模块切换DoSourceChanged会Dispose旧m_CurrentInfo并置null。装饰器Dispose退订流程/模块、输入和显示对象事件，在Dispatcher调用ParentUI.ClearModuleView，再清dataRecords/ShapeList/ResultData、DeInitImageList、停RecordTimer并RenderDataCenter.DeInit。ClearModuleView调用UpdateImageView(null)，普通校验分支进ClearImage，将装饰器.ImageDataSource与curImageData置null；同时清图形/数据网格/图层。上述选定方法没有逐像素Free、共享内存映射释放或ImageData.Dispose调用，因此只能证明各自持有/订阅退出，不能据此断言所有原生像素或已生成位图立即释放。</p><p>representation：装饰器、视图curImageData、ImageViewBox依赖属性、数据中心字典和显示位图是不同持有层；断开这些引用的时间点并非一个。</p><p>cache：切模块释放旧装饰器并建新装饰器；Owner窗口关闭触发置ModuleSource为空；ResultViewAddition扩展仍有独立清理行为。</p><p>release：清图像字段/集合与DeInit是可见收尾步骤，最后原生读者、GC回收和WPF位图内部资源释放仍须另证；不据Dispose名称宣称无泄漏或绝对安全。</p><details><summary>private void OwnerWin_Closed(</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="77eba1381c18ae333c336303e627b674a27b8d40c057c3b62f64ce5f6f65c5ea" href="../../证据/77eba1381c18ae333c336303e627b674a27b8d40c057c3b62f64ce5f6f65c5ea.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>77eba1381c18</small></a></details><details><summary>private void DoSourceChanged(</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6a0665aa30cc6ecd36b589302074079e86f81edb1b0c1c0db4cd2e365000aa61" href="../../证据/6a0665aa30cc6ecd36b589302074079e86f81edb1b0c1c0db4cd2e365000aa61.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6a0665aa30cc</small></a></details><details><summary>public void Dispose()</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3aa76a52b3939a782ed147194741829f4e3a27a60e5e0a174a80bee7107ab459" href="../../证据/3aa76a52b3939a782ed147194741829f4e3a27a60e5e0a174a80bee7107ab459.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3aa76a52b393</small></a></details><details><summary>public void ClearModuleView()</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="58bb804df3e53c239e7a121254001fb01e87ec2215a8a6abc044f44e7bf953fc" href="../../证据/58bb804df3e53c239e7a121254001fb01e87ec2215a8a6abc044f44e7bf953fc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>58bb804df3e5</small></a></details><details><summary>public void ClearImage()</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0238d62ec5416cb8b1cdfcaf9326ab4aeced0f9988b6e041d13037ec111d02e7" href="../../证据/0238d62ec5416cb8b1cdfcaf9326ab4aeced0f9988b6e041d13037ec111d02e7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0238d62ec541</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.ModuleDisplayDecorator::Dispose</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2b50786594b412238a248c254d15b9bca86a6039f0eb8ababaa55035c38b0bab" href="../../证据/2b50786594b412238a248c254d15b9bca86a6039f0eb8ababaa55035c38b0bab.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2b50786594b4</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::ClearImage</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="07ec8671b64589b6cc6d740f35c9c03a6c60b9858519bdf4278b6dd7be01bffe" href="../../证据/07ec8671b64589b6cc6d740f35c9c03a6c60b9858519bdf4278b6dd7be01bffe.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>07ec8671b645</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::OwnerWin_Closed</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f8931fd1ab774876025fc99df65c91318bce22229f27e674c4bc2ef00800ff88" href="../../证据/f8931fd1ab774876025fc99df65c91318bce22229f27e674c4bc2ef00800ff88.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f8931fd1ab77</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：ResultViewAddition.CheckUpdateImageView/OnModuleCallBackArrived可改变清空/呈现分支，扩展组件全部行为未闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：未确认原程序关闭/切换时所有异步工作、消费者与native buffer的最后读者；不得声称本次做过原机内存回收验收。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="RB06"><summary>RB06 · 图像选择清空 / ClearImageView / DeInitRenderControl → 临时仓库和显示引用退役分开</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>imageListCombobox_SelectionChanged在SelectedValue为空时清扩展图形、ShapeList、初始化imageView并将ImageDataSource=null；ClearImageView主图分支也经UpdateImageView(null)清背景引用。DeInitRenderControl则解除显示对象事件/过滤，ModuleParams=null，Dispose图像列表装饰器并分别在锁中清tempImageStore/tempShapeStore，解绑renderStatusModule并减SubscribeCount。该方法没有把ImageDataSource置null，也没有逐图像Dispose，故仓库反初始化、UI清空和原生像素释放不能当作同一个动作。</p><p>representation：控件属性、临时字典、图像列表和事件订阅分别持有或关联对象。</p><p>cache：清空选择与更换模块走不同退役入口；DeInit本身不证明所有显示引用都清空。</p><p>release：装饰器Dispose负责其列表/事件；没有因此证明共享内存生产者或WPF位图已最终销毁。</p><details><summary>private void imageListCombobox_SelectionChanged(</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ab65074ed2ac677a753c19c00fefc1dbe8919aeeb2ea365da4fa1e1f9d9e34e3" href="../../证据/ab65074ed2ac677a753c19c00fefc1dbe8919aeeb2ea365da4fa1e1f9d9e34e3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ab65074ed2ac</small></a></details><details><summary>public void ClearImageView(</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016" href="../../证据/2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2860cadca62d</small></a></details><details><summary>private void UpdateImageView(</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5379587232315e1f33543cbba588658f77897de9d75ee679c24419648fc8651f" href="../../证据/5379587232315e1f33543cbba588658f77897de9d75ee679c24419648fc8651f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>537958723231</small></a></details><details><summary>private void DeInitRenderControl(</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da" href="../../证据/87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>87cd0d7f2ace</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::DeInitRenderControl / 0x0600033c</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bd54f79e142f125a655c4d07e9310e85bb8a245d4d63a47aebeeec9d3c7ab8cc" href="../../证据/bd54f79e142f125a655c4d07e9310e85bb8a245d4d63a47aebeeec9d3c7ab8cc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bd54f79e142f</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：所有Unloaded/模块更换/异常路径是否在飞任务排空后才释放仍未闭合；不从Dispose名称推断最后读者结束。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：源ImageData、imageView内部转换器位图和图形扩展的最终持有者仍须分别核对。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="IF05"><summary>IF05 · ClearImageView / RenderControlBase_Unloaded / DeInitRenderControl → 清引用、退委托不撤销已经排队的工作</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>已核选定ClearImageView调用Init/UpdateImageView(null)或清输入图属性，Unloaded退掉OnSetImageEnd与OnFreshExtendContent委托，DeInitRenderControl解除显示事件/过滤并清临时字典。对应CIL中没有等待此前两条Task.Run返回句柄、DispatcherOperation.Abort或取消token操作；Task调用点又没有保留该句柄。这些动作因此不能作为已排队闭包不再持有控件、不能再读当前状态/调用更新的证明。下一次源为空的ImageViewBox回调仍是自己的同步清显示/通知旧新图像事件链，不构成上游工作排空屏障。</p><p>representation：清空控件属性与排队闭包的强引用是两套可达关系；旧工作仍可通过this访问当前属性/仓库。</p><p>cache：清临时仓库不销毁控件实例，且其它路径可能在其后重新赋ImageDataSource。这里只界定缺少哪一种排空保证，不断言必然覆盖新帧。</p><p>release：退订阻止后续相关事件接入，不撤回已经创建的Task/Dispatcher委托；最后读者与像素释放仍需宿主层关闭协议和运行证据。</p><details><summary>public void ClearImageView(</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016" href="../../证据/2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2860cadca62d</small></a></details><details><summary>private void RenderControlBase_Unloaded(</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e39cf2e044e0798f1f795a7adc873a3db241477cdcfdd684cbff470edd83ea3d" href="../../证据/e39cf2e044e0798f1f795a7adc873a3db241477cdcfdd684cbff470edd83ea3d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e39cf2e044e0</small></a></details><details><summary>private void DeInitRenderControl(</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da" href="../../证据/87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>87cd0d7f2ace</small></a></details><details><summary>private static void ImageSourceChanged(</summary><p>SHA256 d3ed7ce6cca860ac89d671dc0fe4ee239a97063d18bed94d3ad97595d5d52555 / MVID 47136107-aecc-42c7-bdbd-a8641253cae6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="78da8122f6161c9aa648708613f025f50a4209a1f42aabe26f6c313a94a2e957" href="../../证据/78da8122f6161c9aa648708613f025f50a4209a1f42aabe26f6c313a94a2e957.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>78da8122f616</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::ClearImageView / 0x06000345</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a08ab0b721c33446e242502cf2c4106f1e0d38598500426ddc2f545580f7b747" href="../../证据/a08ab0b721c33446e242502cf2c4106f1e0d38598500426ddc2f545580f7b747.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a08ab0b721c3</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::RenderControlBase_Unloaded / 0x06000338</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d70a3f93d6248c0e21e63579ce85439cfe4021c3f9e5ea13e84e9afb111c08b3" href="../../证据/d70a3f93d6248c0e21e63579ce85439cfe4021c3f9e5ea13e84e9afb111c08b3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d70a3f93d624</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::DeInitRenderControl / 0x0600033c</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b970a4656f4def286a3239e695f0526a178ef6053f39264e9cc12eb5f24e58da" href="../../证据/b970a4656f4def286a3239e695f0526a178ef6053f39264e9cc12eb5f24e58da.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b970a4656f4d</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：不能仅凭选定体没有取消调用断言原程序全局不存在排空；进程/父窗口关闭及其它所有者仍需独立追踪。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：未观察原机清空/卸载与回调竞争，实际过期呈现、异常或内存滞留是否发生及概率均未知。</p></details></details></article><article data-retirement-side="current"><h4>当前：独立实现</h4><p><strong>停止并等执行结束，与清宿主保存的结果是两步。</strong></p><p><strong>谁持有：</strong>ToolDebugSession.active、配置调度器LastResult、宿主configurationResults/toolDebugRecords可能分别持有记录。</p><p><strong>已确认的收尾：</strong>独立调试窗关闭会等待session.DisposeAsync后移除session集合项；普通配置关闭撤销晚发布资格。</p><p><strong>此后仍可能存在：</strong>StopAsync/DisposeAsync不会因此清LastResult；关闭配置没有在该链清configurationResults。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：完成Task和已缓存记录的最终可达性需逐持有者判断，不能从窗口不可见推出像素全部释放。</p><details><summary>逐段展开成员、分支与源码</summary><details data-retirement-proof="CR05"><summary>CR05 · 工具调试 / 普通配置自执行 / 关闭编辑器 → 停止调度与LastResult、Task结果、宿主缓存分别退役</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>当前实际类型是ToolDebugSession和ExecutionSessionResult，并未发现名为ToolExecutionSession/RunRecord的同一实体。ToolDebugSession.active保存Start返回的Task，完成finally仅清取消源/更新状态，不把active置null；若为RunOnce，该完成Task可继续持有NodeRunRecord直到active被下次Start替换或session不再可达。StopAsync取消并等待active，不清已保存结果。普通配置调度ToolConfigurationExecution.Dispatch开始把LastResult=null，完成再置结果；StopAsync只取消轮询并等loop，不清LastResult；DisposeAsync再等待inFlight也不清它。宿主RunConfiguredTool按owner/配置存活/节点身份准入后缓存record，不限成功状态；关闭配置可阻止晚发布，但CloseToolConfiguration没有清configurationResults。独立调试窗口的关闭另等待session.DisposeAsync后移除session集合项，不等同清宿主toolDebugRecords。</p><p>representation：完成Task&lt;T>、配置执行器LastResult、configurationResults、toolDebugRecords和工具窗口LastResult是独立持有者，不能统一命名成一个“会话结果”。</p><p>cache：正常失败record可覆盖配置缓存旧记录；配置失活导致不发布时旧configurationResults可留存。调试Invalidate还只做宿主特定失效标记，不消灭其它session旧引用。</p><p>release：停止、Dispose调度器、从窗口集合移除、清LastResult和清宿主记录是不同动作；不能从窗口关闭推断所有输出图像已释放。</p><details><summary> Task? active;</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5222f1b9a88904f5a5dd94c33435abff4b170b6f582a9d88d7307170b623d7e2" href="../../证据/5222f1b9a88904f5a5dd94c33435abff4b170b6f582a9d88d7307170b623d7e2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5222f1b9a889</small></a></details><details><summary>   async Task&lt;T> Execute()</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d22473d11e55a85136428f9e85871a4c9736e0216fcbf94f8a3303db959972b7" href="../../证据/d22473d11e55a85136428f9e85871a4c9736e0216fcbf94f8a3303db959972b7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d22473d11e55</small></a></details><details><summary> public async Task StopAsync()</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d03635ba61cc497e221d27abad4f95c8d21f7cb872d50b0fb5e6dd404ab34392" href="../../证据/d03635ba61cc497e221d27abad4f95c8d21f7cb872d50b0fb5e6dd404ab34392.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d03635ba61cc</small></a></details><details><summary> async Task Dispatch(){</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="17ad97750ddbdb1eca5d670992614b5fe04923e8de8d4a7bbbcd98abe89eaee7" href="../../证据/17ad97750ddbdb1eca5d670992614b5fe04923e8de8d4a7bbbcd98abe89eaee7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>17ad97750ddb</small></a></details><details><summary> public async Task StopAsync(){</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7c2e184d34c38dc51b4a341154c21fafa817e27a26c993f0044adab6a2445b38" href="../../证据/7c2e184d34c38dc51b4a341154c21fafa817e27a26c993f0044adab6a2445b38.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7c2e184d34c3</small></a></details><details><summary>  }catch(Exception ex){record=new(nodeId,</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="de435e16af18ef654977ecb4f322f199172aff53db1a457fbad80574ea25f742" href="../../证据/de435e16af18ef654977ecb4f322f199172aff53db1a457fbad80574ea25f742.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>de435e16af18</small></a></details><details><summary> void CloseToolConfiguration()</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4ae7013d1039c64b158076a59b90b6c4159192d58e7127db05904e773c209bde" href="../../证据/4ae7013d1039c64b158076a59b90b6c4159192d58e7127db05904e773c209bde.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4ae7013d1039</small></a></details><details><summary> void BindToolEditorLifetime(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="560abd8d493dc3cc55d6ab695ea2bd4fc81bd84bd083e5db864f3f7b81b9b5f6" href="../../证据/560abd8d493dc3cc55d6ab695ea2bd4fc81bd84bd083e5db864f3f7b81b9b5f6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>560abd8d493d</small></a></details><details><summary> void StoreToolDebugResult(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f654b99be7096785ff5c4c306c63f24c34a67a6f083c5615d6e9f4840bb586e3" href="../../证据/f654b99be7096785ff5c4c306c63f24c34a67a6f083c5615d6e9f4840bb586e3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f654b99be709</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：Task对象是否实际继续可达取决于窗口/context/session持有；此处只指出字段可达链，不声称关闭后必然泄漏。工具窗口内部额外结果/图像字段仍按各工具另核。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="TD07"><summary>TD07 · IToolDisplayProvider.LastDisplay → 三presenter → frame持有 / 图像层位图 / 文本和结果投影</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>RefreshToolDisplay按请求代次、execution owner和当前流程判Current，先Show(null)清旧显示，再在node有结果且实现provider时取frame；Current通过后把同一frame传给图像、记录和结果列表presenter。图像presenter把Frame字段设为frame，清文字/几何children与旧image.Source/图像层，然后按选中图像和勾选层重建WPF图像。Bitmap辅助函数同样Pixels.ToArray→BitmapSource.Create→Freeze。记录presenter只取RecordText，列表presenter把ResultList投影为一个字典行；不能把这两者说成持有相同的整帧字段。</p><p>representation：image presenter.Frame保留完整ToolDisplayFrame；各图像层另有BitmapSource副本；TextBlock/表行是另一种投影。</p><p>cache：清frame后尺寸归1；provider可能仍持有最近输出。最多三勾选图像层及文字/图形按frame重建。</p><p>release：Show(null)置Frame=null并移除该presenter的图像/标签引用，不调用frame.Image.Dispose或清provider缓存；同一图像的其它持有者继续有效。</p><details><summary>long request=++toolDisplayRequestGeneration</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="011023208dd4062299060f59880a42a7b6c3a347c961a8082a16f314694d4cd0" href="../../证据/011023208dd4062299060f59880a42a7b6c3a347c961a8082a16f314694d4cd0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>011023208dd4</small></a></details><details><summary>Frame = frame; labels.Children.Clear(); image.Source = null;</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5c262edb8d5033f223006a465497bad17a1acb92da5c65898c4b6fe51b506a17" href="../../证据/5c262edb8d5033f223006a465497bad17a1acb92da5c65898c4b6fe51b506a17.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5c262edb8d50</small></a></details><details><summary>var selectedLayer=frame.SelectedImageName</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="187a9b03f59713dabc98ef98fbd993721025a132f378bb576a3df9eb4d8dbd02" href="../../证据/187a9b03f59713dabc98ef98fbd993721025a132f378bb576a3df9eb4d8dbd02.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>187a9b03f597</small></a></details><details><summary>public void Show(ToolDisplayFrame? frame) { Text</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d83ceb0af29dbefc84e08ee90d7f67f206a59ced14a87db29e445ec9f42c2cc" href="../../证据/0d83ceb0af29dbefc84e08ee90d7f67f206a59ced14a87db29e445ec9f42c2cc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d83ceb0af29</small></a></details><details><summary>Columns.Clear(); ItemsSource = null;</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f4570afb88fcff97092854091ef3fef6e654e2d4ab2518e002cc9add9732b19c" href="../../证据/f4570afb88fcff97092854091ef3fef6e654e2d4ab2518e002cc9add9732b19c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f4570afb88fc</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：不因Current门或Freeze推断所有生产者线程安全；原版文字/几何/native图像的最后读者和生命周期仍独立核对。</p></details></details></article></div></details><details data-retirement-operation="delete"><summary>③ 删除节点：节点不在画布上，旧图像就释放了吗？</summary><div class="dd-stage-columns"><article data-retirement-side="original"><h4>原版：已证片段与未知父级桥</h4><p><strong>模块Dispose会断IO关联并关闭SDK模块；IO值与旧显示的最后持有者还要分别追。</strong></p><p><strong>谁持有：</strong>所选装饰器、图像列表、结果仓库和已排队通知可能分别持有载荷。</p><p><strong>已确认的收尾：</strong>VmModule.Dispose经CommonDispose逐IO.Dispose、移出模块集合并请求CloseOneModule；VmIO.Dispose移出父集合并断RelateIO，却不直接清_value/_valueList。装饰器退役与显示清空是另有条件的路径。IsDisposeNotify的已证SearchDryPopup消费者只退搜索事件，不能当作清图触发器。</p><p><strong>此后仍可能存在：</strong>这些方法不能单独证明删除模块后所有异步读者和native像素已退出。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：尚未把具体删除入口、同一模块实例、显示退役和生产者最终回收连成完整已证链；不把Dispose片段当成删除全过程。</p><details><summary>逐段展开成员、分支与源码</summary><details data-retirement-proof="OR02"><summary>OR02 · ProcedureConfigControl流程容器更换/Remove/Reset → 解除集合订阅、移除装饰项与条件清选中项</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>OnProceduresChanged对旧集合RemoveHandler并ClearProcedures，对新集合先Remove再Add CollectionChanged handler，随后按复制状态重新AddProcedures。ClearProcedures调用ResetDisposeStatus把IsDisposeNotify先true再false，再清DecoratedProcedures/DecoratedModules。Remove通知逐来源移除匹配装饰项，并仅在OldItems含当前DecorateSource时把SelectedItem/SelectedTabItem置null；Reset调用ClearProcedures。所选体没有逐装饰项调用Dispose。</p><p>representation：装饰集合、选中项、通知布尔与底层模块结果仓分开；集合Clear仅撤销该容器的引用。</p><p>cache：集合与选择变化可能再由binding触发视图换源；本事实不将该后续关系自动升级为已证的图像释放。</p><p>release：Remove/Clear/取消订阅已见，未见直接像素释放；原显示换源后的局部DeInit是已有V02/V12等独立关系。</p><details><summary>ProcedureConfigControl.OnProceduresChanged and Clear/Remove</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0ebd1cd7c85e604d2eb842e30a7156a103a019508e466ffb4b99f6422754ad32" href="../../证据/0ebd1cd7c85e604d2eb842e30a7156a103a019508e466ffb4b99f6422754ad32.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0ebd1cd7c85e</small></a></details><details><summary>ProcedureConfigControl.Procedures_CollectionChanged</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="302ef77afbc17b5c17cd08f4da2c761586626c3e34313e5f7ff67593dfc5625c" href="../../证据/302ef77afbc17b5c17cd08f4da2c761586626c3e34313e5f7ff67593dfc5625c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>302ef77afbc1</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：已定位SearchDryPopup一个消费者及其退搜索事件行为；其它消费者与Release包装Dispose的更外层caller仍未闭合；包装层到MainViewControl的直接调用另见OR07。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：单模块删除的所有选择同步和全部UI消费者未闭合；不能以流程集合Remove代表所有模块删除都已清屏。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="OR04"><summary>OR04 · VmModule.Dispose → CommonDispose → VmIO.Dispose → 撤关联/移出模型及交SDK关闭模块；IO值字段不由Dispose直接清空</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>VmModule.Dispose先设置IsOnDispose并拒绝重复disposedValue；清变量关联、可选导出Undo数据、删除内部模块、解除前后继与参数绑定，然后CommonDispose。CommonDispose反向删除NextModules、调用父UnSubInnerModule，再逆序Dispose每个Inputs/Outputs。VmIO.Dispose对子项递归Dispose，CollectionParent.Remove(this)、RelateIO=null、disposedValue=true；所选体没有直接写_value或_valueList。模块随后移出父Modules与AllModules，再CloseModuleInterface→SDK CloseOneModule。删除结构/断IO关系和结果载荷最后读者不是同一保证。</p><p>representation：模块、IO对象、IO的Value/ValueList、Undo导出对象与显示装饰器各自可持有数据；不把所有权合并进一个Dispose。</p><p>cache：可选Undo导出本身可能保留对象；其内容与原/native资源所有权本轮没有展开。</p><p>release：已证模型移除与SDK CloseOneModule调用，native末端销毁、旧IO外部引用和显示仓最后读者未知；不由方法名宣称像素free。</p><details><summary>VmModule.Dispose</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / retained manifest MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a5b6e186007280557e1210b314f2380ba97c283370ed8c605740367c8fc4cbac" href="../../证据/a5b6e186007280557e1210b314f2380ba97c283370ed8c605740367c8fc4cbac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a5b6e1860072</small></a></details><details><summary>VmModule.CommonDispose and CloseModuleInterface</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / retained manifest MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2ab54e649a807b2a3d5121b39dadc80c41442f139b0f3ddc217a96b7f25dacb0" href="../../证据/2ab54e649a807b2a3d5121b39dadc80c41442f139b0f3ddc217a96b7f25dacb0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2ab54e649a80</small></a></details><details><summary>VmIO.Dispose</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / retained manifest MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7211c13fdb00ec0d027c6fb98d3e836e9ee09f7acc514bd32673da848427d921" href="../../证据/7211c13fdb00ec0d027c6fb98d3e836e9ee09f7acc514bd32673da848427d921.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7211c13fdb00</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：CloseOneModule底层句柄/缓冲退出、删除后旧显示装饰器是否收到换源通知及所有最后读者未在本切片闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：异常时IsOnDispose复位不等于前面已完成的IO/模型移除具有事务回滚。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="OR08"><summary>OR08 · ResetDisposeStatus → ZoomArea SearchDryPopup.IsDisposeNotify → true通知只解除搜索控件事件，不调用图像Dispose</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ProcedureConfigControl.ResetDisposeStatus将IsDisposeNotify先true再false。保留ZoomArea.xaml将祖先ProcedureConfigControl的该属性绑定到DryPopup.IsDisposeNotify；该DP注册OnDisposeStatusChanged，只有NewValue=true才DeleteSelf。DeleteSelf解除TextBox的TextChanged/LostFocus/GotFocus、清除按钮Click及宿主Window的LocationChanged/Deactivated，再_window=null。所选完整体没有调用MainViewControl.Dispose，不清图像或模块结果；这条通知不能再被当成图像释放触发器。</p><p>representation：搜索弹窗、其宿主Window事件引用、MainViewControl图像来源和结果仓分开。</p><p>cache：退搜索事件仅影响所列订阅；DeleteSelf本体也没有清SearchResultCollection或销毁渲染仓的合同。</p><p>release：这一个已定位消费者的局部事件退役已证；其余消费者、模板活绑定及像素最后读者均另列。</p><details><summary>ProcedureConfigControl.ResetDisposeStatus</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3375484b483239e0751c17bca2580121e8e95cb7cfb59ad9a9e19160d03676be" href="../../证据/3375484b483239e0751c17bca2580121e8e95cb7cfb59ad9a9e19160d03676be.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3375484b4832</small></a></details><details><summary>ZoomArea SearchDryPopup.IsDisposeNotify binding</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fdf6f7ea70fb89883a6856e1060489ce7ec6a3692d54af0631acea42bcd0100c" href="../../证据/fdf6f7ea70fb89883a6856e1060489ce7ec6a3692d54af0631acea42bcd0100c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fdf6f7ea70fb</small></a></details><details><summary>SearchDryPopup.IsDisposeNotify registration</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="435b9009f142317bc6ab4da9a1d4da3b33f4bab34e2e0fe78f9628d74d31ca82" href="../../证据/435b9009f142317bc6ab4da9a1d4da3b33f4bab34e2e0fe78f9628d74d31ca82.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>435b9009f142</small></a></details><details><summary>SearchDryPopup.OnDisposeStatusChanged and DeleteSelf</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="027e1e5619a259e94d10d13d58c00dceebd323a96eca915ff4b20b805744b306" href="../../证据/027e1e5619a259e94d10d13d58c00dceebd323a96eca915ff4b20b805744b306.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>027e1e5619a2</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：当前只闭合一个静态模板消费者；原模板是否在特定宿主激活、其它IsDisposeNotify消费者与重复模板应用生命周期未穷举。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="RS05"><summary>RS05 · 模块切换 / OwnerWin_Closed / 装饰器Dispose → 清图像字段、退订事件、清缓存与原始像素寿命分列</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>OwnerWin_Closed把ModuleSource设null，普通模块切换DoSourceChanged会Dispose旧m_CurrentInfo并置null。装饰器Dispose退订流程/模块、输入和显示对象事件，在Dispatcher调用ParentUI.ClearModuleView，再清dataRecords/ShapeList/ResultData、DeInitImageList、停RecordTimer并RenderDataCenter.DeInit。ClearModuleView调用UpdateImageView(null)，普通校验分支进ClearImage，将装饰器.ImageDataSource与curImageData置null；同时清图形/数据网格/图层。上述选定方法没有逐像素Free、共享内存映射释放或ImageData.Dispose调用，因此只能证明各自持有/订阅退出，不能据此断言所有原生像素或已生成位图立即释放。</p><p>representation：装饰器、视图curImageData、ImageViewBox依赖属性、数据中心字典和显示位图是不同持有层；断开这些引用的时间点并非一个。</p><p>cache：切模块释放旧装饰器并建新装饰器；Owner窗口关闭触发置ModuleSource为空；ResultViewAddition扩展仍有独立清理行为。</p><p>release：清图像字段/集合与DeInit是可见收尾步骤，最后原生读者、GC回收和WPF位图内部资源释放仍须另证；不据Dispose名称宣称无泄漏或绝对安全。</p><details><summary>private void OwnerWin_Closed(</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="77eba1381c18ae333c336303e627b674a27b8d40c057c3b62f64ce5f6f65c5ea" href="../../证据/77eba1381c18ae333c336303e627b674a27b8d40c057c3b62f64ce5f6f65c5ea.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>77eba1381c18</small></a></details><details><summary>private void DoSourceChanged(</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6a0665aa30cc6ecd36b589302074079e86f81edb1b0c1c0db4cd2e365000aa61" href="../../证据/6a0665aa30cc6ecd36b589302074079e86f81edb1b0c1c0db4cd2e365000aa61.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6a0665aa30cc</small></a></details><details><summary>public void Dispose()</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3aa76a52b3939a782ed147194741829f4e3a27a60e5e0a174a80bee7107ab459" href="../../证据/3aa76a52b3939a782ed147194741829f4e3a27a60e5e0a174a80bee7107ab459.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3aa76a52b393</small></a></details><details><summary>public void ClearModuleView()</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="58bb804df3e53c239e7a121254001fb01e87ec2215a8a6abc044f44e7bf953fc" href="../../证据/58bb804df3e53c239e7a121254001fb01e87ec2215a8a6abc044f44e7bf953fc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>58bb804df3e5</small></a></details><details><summary>public void ClearImage()</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0238d62ec5416cb8b1cdfcaf9326ab4aeced0f9988b6e041d13037ec111d02e7" href="../../证据/0238d62ec5416cb8b1cdfcaf9326ab4aeced0f9988b6e041d13037ec111d02e7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0238d62ec541</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.ModuleDisplayDecorator::Dispose</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2b50786594b412238a248c254d15b9bca86a6039f0eb8ababaa55035c38b0bab" href="../../证据/2b50786594b412238a248c254d15b9bca86a6039f0eb8ababaa55035c38b0bab.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2b50786594b4</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::ClearImage</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="07ec8671b64589b6cc6d740f35c9c03a6c60b9858519bdf4278b6dd7be01bffe" href="../../证据/07ec8671b64589b6cc6d740f35c9c03a6c60b9858519bdf4278b6dd7be01bffe.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>07ec8671b645</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::OwnerWin_Closed</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f8931fd1ab774876025fc99df65c91318bce22229f27e674c4bc2ef00800ff88" href="../../证据/f8931fd1ab774876025fc99df65c91318bce22229f27e674c4bc2ef00800ff88.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f8931fd1ab77</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：ResultViewAddition.CheckUpdateImageView/OnModuleCallBackArrived可改变清空/呈现分支，扩展组件全部行为未闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：未确认原程序关闭/切换时所有异步工作、消费者与native buffer的最后读者；不得声称本次做过原机内存回收验收。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="RC04"><summary>RC04 · ClearDisplayStore / Init / DeInit → 仅清当前display、清三仓及迟到回调的边界</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ClearDisplayStore仅Clear当前display图像/图形字典，不改buffer/spare、三个计数、两个固定标志或SelectedImage等选择引用。Init只设isInit=true。DeInit则设isInit=false，Clear三套图像/图形字典，清计数和固定标志，置CheckImagesName/SelectedImage/SelectedInputImage为空；没有逐图Dispose或像素free。SetRenderDataToStore以isInit阻止继续入值，但SetDataToStore本身并未先检查isInit：反初始化后迟到的有效回调仍可更新仓库计数和走Clear，然后在下层不存值。所以DeInit不等同所有生产回调已经停止或排空。</p><p>representation：清仓、清选择身份、禁止下层存值、原生像素释放是四个不同层次；A链ModuleResultView另持有的ImageData不由此字段写入直接清掉。</p><p>cache：ClearDisplayStore仍保留两待写仓里的旧图；DeInit删除三仓持有，但已交给装饰器、视图或扩展消费者的对象可继续可达。</p><p>release：所选清理体没有调用ImageData.Dispose、FreeHGlobal或共享映射关闭；不能用DeInit的完成代替最后读者和所有像素已释放的证据。</p><details><summary>public void ClearDisplayStore()</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9dfdc6e88917df22aa767bba9224c59f9310e9ae411914e3d226142b79076ecf" href="../../证据/9dfdc6e88917df22aa767bba9224c59f9310e9ae411914e3d226142b79076ecf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9dfdc6e88917</small></a></details><details><summary>public void Init()</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="910f799075bb238e56c41844ac5bb0ff53e40938b44941a317a8de903f057cf2" href="../../证据/910f799075bb238e56c41844ac5bb0ff53e40938b44941a317a8de903f057cf2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>910f799075bb</small></a></details><details><summary>public void DeInit()</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4119f226ce97808b04ee46443250f6e4d6ae12953659bee3e485b9f31ad23e42" href="../../证据/4119f226ce97808b04ee46443250f6e4d6ae12953659bee3e485b9f31ad23e42.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4119f226ce97</small></a></details><details><summary>public void SetDataToStore(</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d2098082e0ba811f958441d3b1c94c72080086d8abeda85f96f507340e9eb3d" href="../../证据/0d2098082e0ba811f958441d3b1c94c72080086d8abeda85f96f507340e9eb3d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d2098082e0b</small></a></details><details><summary>private void SetRenderDataToStore(</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bb787362f3f60cc2eca9784e9377a135b040cb61c81a2304af095ffa2ce132ac" href="../../证据/bb787362f3f60cc2eca9784e9377a135b040cb61c81a2304af095ffa2ce132ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bb787362f3f6</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::ClearDisplayStore</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2dab3ce386c5cdd8936ba2893c26bd5a9df2302492d1c1847d3f6b05d4a9e792" href="../../证据/2dab3ce386c5cdd8936ba2893c26bd5a9df2302492d1c1847d3f6b05d4a9e792.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2dab3ce386c5</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::DeInit</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cb340b8a33164e25592f527c23b4fb6ca600d3347037e5f19067e60c79fb2b95" href="../../证据/cb340b8a33164e25592f527c23b4fb6ca600d3347037e5f19067e60c79fb2b95.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cb340b8a3316</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::Init</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="aeb564366760ee8d7a09e3269f25f302bfcc439ce5884fc9e8a19bdb3813037b" href="../../证据/aeb564366760ee8d7a09e3269f25f302bfcc439ce5884fc9e8a19bdb3813037b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>aeb564366760</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：三仓只属于RenderDataCenter→ModuleResultView/ModuleDisplayDecorator的A链；不得归到没有引用RenderDataCenter的RenderControlBase/tempImageStore B链。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：原机异步排空、外部消费者、图像/位图与native资源最终释放仍未验证。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="ON04"><summary>ON04 · ObjectBase.OnValueChanged / Object.ClearValueStore → 事件接收与聚合清理各有边界</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ObjectBase.OnValueChanged调用ValueChanged(this,args)，事件处理异常被该体捕获并记录。Object.ClearValueStore先把临时value替换成新List&lt;object>并清valueExecuteCount，再清非固定Feature槽并要求Feature下轮重建；没有逐图像Dispose。Clear并不会修改已经入队的RenderDataEventArgs.Value，因此旧通知在没有其它门阻止时仍可能继续被接收。接收方仍须按其自己的owner/计数/忙碌门决定入仓与呈现。</p><p>representation：事件args.Value、Object.value、Feature.ValueStore与队列Tuple不是同一个持有位置。</p><p>cache：清聚合容器不撤销队列中既有引用；数据仓与UI的执行计数门需沿后续链核对。</p><p>release：仅清引用/重建标记；未在本体回收所有ImageData像素或原生共享资源。</p><details><summary>internal void OnValueChanged(</summary><p>SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="56b33bf756cbf1d1c48606f952cbb2c1358904881251c1354c8c547dcc63b071" href="../../证据/56b33bf756cbf1d1c48606f952cbb2c1358904881251c1354c8c547dcc63b071.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>56b33bf756cb</small></a></details><details><summary>internal override void ClearTempValue()</summary><p>SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3447f3a7f9cb7bb54779fae8e0a8e6fc25ef6df7a96eeb8bbf03d20545a494ce" href="../../证据/3447f3a7f9cb7bb54779fae8e0a8e6fc25ef6df7a96eeb8bbf03d20545a494ce.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3447f3a7f9cb</small></a></details><details><summary>public void ClearValueStore()</summary><p>SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0418005d0b222840ef02cf08de56542075d1e4bfc685465ce919c8185c47fa1b" href="../../证据/0418005d0b222840ef02cf08de56542075d1e4bfc685465ce919c8185c47fa1b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0418005d0b22</small></a></details><details><summary>Apps.XmlParser.ObjectBase::OnValueChanged 0x06000133</summary><p>SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e74d3a2f1bff9f5f819e3a3d12fc9ea445caf3070defc67ad67b89208a5f3ba7" href="../../证据/e74d3a2f1bff9f5f819e3a3d12fc9ea445caf3070defc67ad67b89208a5f3ba7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e74d3a2f1bff</small></a></details><details><summary>Apps.XmlParser.Object::ClearValueStore 0x060001dd</summary><p>SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="351b401031a60718ade58c9b27583f10ce7f4ac08e4cee1929b1e62389f60749" href="../../证据/351b401031a60718ade58c9b27583f10ce7f4ac08e4cee1929b1e62389f60749.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>351b401031a6</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：某一处理器异常对多订阅者分发的具体影响、日志处理自身失败和所有订阅者的生命周期仍需另证；不把异常被记录等同全部处理成功。</p></details></details></article><article data-retirement-side="current"><h4>当前：独立实现</h4><p><strong>删除文档节点会退役对应scope状态，但不按节点裁剪所有旧结果容器。</strong></p><p><strong>谁持有：</strong>文档节点、scope state、workflowSessions、configurationResults和toolDebugRecords是不同持有者。</p><p><strong>已确认的收尾：</strong>Changed后RetainExecutionNodes保留现存节点集合；scope移除对应参数缓存/state，state实现IDisposable时才调用Dispose。</p><p><strong>此后仍可能存在：</strong>删除链不逐节点裁旧sessions和配置/调试记录；ImageSource.State.Dispose只关Folder，不主动清Cache/PendingFrame/StitchBuffer。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：移除state可达关系和Dispose其资源不等于旧图像已无其它持有者。单节点Dispose抛错会中断Retain后续裁剪，参数和state可能处于不同裁剪阶段，见CSR02。</p><details><summary>逐段展开成员、分支与源码</summary><details data-retirement-proof="CR03"><summary>CR03 · GraphEditorDocument.DeleteNodes → Changed → scope节点状态移除不等于裁剪旧session/配置记录</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>DeleteNodes修改节点、连线与配置引用，Edit提交文档后发Changed；主窗Changed调用ValidateToolConfigurationOwner、RetainExecutionNodes和刷新。RetainExecutionNodes只将现存(过程,模块,节点)集合交scope.RetainProcedureNodes并裁剪pointAliasPresentation。scope移除对应参数缓存与state，state若IDisposable才Dispose。这个删除链没有按被删节点裁剪workflowSessions.Nodes、configurationResults或toolDebugRecords；这些容器先前保存的记录不能因文档节点消失而推定已释放。</p><p>representation：编辑文档的节点/JSON历史与运行NodeRunRecord在不同容器；删除图结构不自动改写历史运行session。</p><p>cache：configurationResults还可保存已删节点的旧记录；新配置请求available从旧session与configurationResults组装引用视图。具体能否再被有效订阅消费仍受当前文档解析和验证限制。</p><p>release：scope移除仅退役该层state持有；显示不再列出节点不等于所有结果载荷不可达。</p><details><summary>    public void DeleteNodes(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="55d45978667d8145c9adc9da30a45d75ec8b9741f7221a07673f0ad6d36d96be" href="../../证据/55d45978667d8145c9adc9da30a45d75ec8b9741f7221a07673f0ad6d36d96be.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>55d45978667d</small></a></details><details><summary>        SolutionStore.ValidateStructure(next); RecordEditHistory();</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b89579065a8ee9f9af3570bc103d2944630d50bee54ddd11515cddf3118608d2" href="../../证据/b89579065a8ee9f9af3570bc103d2944630d50bee54ddd11515cddf3118608d2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b89579065a8e</small></a></details><details><summary>doc.Changed+=()=></summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bff6c0b3eb0883dc1057b705e28b693ec36d082a6414ba5eb28abcc7bdbffb85" href="../../证据/bff6c0b3eb0883dc1057b705e28b693ec36d082a6414ba5eb28abcc7bdbffb85.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bff6c0b3eb08</small></a></details><details><summary> void RetainExecutionNodes()</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="649bacd49f444bba56b31e370305693a6359a602663d27765cad1dce2840a31b" href="../../证据/649bacd49f444bba56b31e370305693a6359a602663d27765cad1dce2840a31b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>649bacd49f44</small></a></details><details><summary> public void RemoveNode(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ff088aad88d8d8409e0a4d415d967d2fc4b0ac692180e6de62f6c72fa4d32e69" href="../../证据/ff088aad88d8d8409e0a4d415d967d2fc4b0ac692180e6de62f6c72fa4d32e69.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ff088aad88d8</small></a></details><details><summary> void RetainProcedureNodes(IEnumerable&lt;(string Procedure,string Module,string Node)> current,string? only)</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fd003545d04d7cbe309b8965e71c44483cfb2bdcf37af963fb6bf3978a7ab2ac" href="../../证据/fd003545d04d7cbe309b8965e71c44483cfb2bdcf37af963fb6bf3978a7ab2ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fd003545d04d</small></a></details><details><summary>  var available=(workflowSessions.TryGetValue(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="981b8452e46fdcdc33b3db47f2114d8e3c2f5be28823b36d88836b7b543560a6" href="../../证据/981b8452e46fdcdc33b3db47f2114d8e3c2f5be28823b36d88836b7b543560a6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>981b8452e46f</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：只证明所选删除/Changed链没有这些裁剪，不宣称任意其它用户动作永远不会清记录；结果字典的最终可达时刻未测。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="CR04"><summary>CR04 · ImageSource状态缓存 / SDK待提交帧 / ImageBuffer FIFO → scope退役、Reset、像素格式变化分别影响哪些持有者</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>ImageSource.State除Cache还持PendingFrame及StitchBuffer；其Dispose仅Dispose Folder并置null，不主动Clear Cache、清PendingFrame或StitchBuffer。SDK提交以Interlocked.Exchange替换PendingFrame，执行SDK模式再Exchange为null取走，不克隆。文件模式仅像素格式变化时Clear Cache，路径命中复用同一图像；缓存容量参数只限制新准入，不在此段按减少后的容量主动裁剪。ImageBuffer.State不是IDisposable，FIFO淘汰/Reset及scope移除均只是移除特定持有，旧结果仍可指向已出队图像（复制/发布见TD03）。主窗InvalidateSourceResults清results、调用fallback Reset并移除scope节点，却未在此方法清workflowSessions或configurationResults。</p><p>representation：源Cache、PendingFrame、拼接数组、FIFO和NodeRunRecord是不同持有者；State.Dispose并不表示它的每个字段被清空。</p><p>cache：即使state从scope字典移除，正在运行的局部state引用或旧结果仍可能继续持有像素；停止不触发这里的Reset。</p><p>release：是否由GC回收取决于其它引用；本切片只报告显式字段/容器变化，不宣称旧字节立刻归还系统。</p><details><summary> sealed class State:IDisposable</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="89f6bf8036f5d726b62111368975cd50b32b1df8611de20688bbe3fe4a9d7186" href="../../证据/89f6bf8036f5d726b62111368975cd50b32b1df8611de20688bbe3fe4a9d7186.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>89f6bf8036f5</small></a></details><details><summary> public void SubmitImage(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e95d5c3ddca051a3b34f99a3ef3062deccf4070cd0b6ca5ec44633d55904fad8" href="../../证据/e95d5c3ddca051a3b34f99a3ef3062deccf4070cd0b6ca5ec44633d55904fad8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e95d5c3ddca0</small></a></details><details><summary> public void Reset(ModuleExecutionScope</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="92647cab0979a813914ff1ef88765ab76ac3b815ed8d7b195e4036d4c90da105" href="../../证据/92647cab0979a813914ff1ef88765ab76ac3b815ed8d7b195e4036d4c90da105.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>92647cab0979</small></a></details><details><summary> public void Reset(string nodeId)</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13df7359670c7f42485010007d0b0a3f25d04ade90e0b15f27e73159f7cf1943" href="../../证据/13df7359670c7f42485010007d0b0a3f25d04ade90e0b15f27e73159f7cf1943.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13df7359670c</small></a></details><details><summary>    if(state.PixelFormat!=</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c9b08bf7272fe19106c06837d18e8fe34de27125b37fc2d2276a77a8ea75d91d" href="../../证据/c9b08bf7272fe19106c06837d18e8fe34de27125b37fc2d2276a77a8ea75d91d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c9b08bf7272f</small></a></details><details><summary>     image=Interlocked.Exchange(ref state.PendingFrame,null)!;</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="30ce5b0d645bf5ba8fa53f0cded075c39a1ec1afa54cb9cd0511427e6077413b" href="../../证据/30ce5b0d645bf5ba8fa53f0cded075c39a1ec1afa54cb9cd0511427e6077413b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>30ce5b0d645b</small></a></details><details><summary> sealed class State {</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3cd0cb0fbffbb7a8227782f59fd5f627759a587ca5984feb13b1e97e1d90e5cf" href="../../证据/3cd0cb0fbffbb7a8227782f59fd5f627759a587ca5984feb13b1e97e1d90e5cf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3cd0cb0fbffb</small></a></details><details><summary> void InvalidateSourceResults(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9768a53926729a080ff8249575d37b3e3fce7bbc03804fea3956145139ca4818" href="../../证据/9768a53926729a080ff8249575d37b3e3fce7bbc03804fea3956145139ca4818.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9768a5392672</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：无scope fallback状态的外部调用/所有Reset时序未穷尽；已知的托管持有关系不能替代native相机帧租用与释放证据。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="IS09"><summary>IS09 · Reset / State.Dispose / scope退役 → 撤销状态持有 ≠ 确定释放所有像素</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>State.Dispose仅关闭Folder并设null，没有清Cache、PendingFrame、StitchBuffer，也没有Dispose Execution信号量。Reset(scope,node)通过scope.RemoveNode移除同procedure状态并调用State.Dispose；无scope的Reset(node)只从插件states字典移除，不调用被移除State.Dispose。root方案scope关闭先取消，等租约归零后清状态/拥有服务并Dispose可释放者；borrowed procedure scope.Dispose直接返回。因此不能把工具窗口关闭、单轮Runtime结束、Reset和方案关闭当成同一个释放事件。</p><p>representation：State、结果记录、预览图像和外部提交者是可能独立的引用持有者。</p><p>cache：State从字典移除后仍可能暂被在飞执行持有；旧结果可继续持有已产生的图像。</p><p>release：这里确认的是移除状态、关闭watcher与scope清理；没有像素归零、立即GC或所有外部读者终止的保证。</p><details><summary>public void Dispose(){Folder?.Dispose();Folder=null;}</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b36ca791d92511568353cf1fb0d33867c4bf213aced36bdd042b169c60610ac9" href="../../证据/b36ca791d92511568353cf1fb0d33867c4bf213aced36bdd042b169c60610ac9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b36ca791d925</small></a></details><details><summary>public void Reset(ModuleExecutionScope</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="92647cab0979a813914ff1ef88765ab76ac3b815ed8d7b195e4036d4c90da105" href="../../证据/92647cab0979a813914ff1ef88765ab76ac3b815ed8d7b195e4036d4c90da105.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>92647cab0979</small></a></details><details><summary>public void Reset(string nodeId)</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13df7359670c7f42485010007d0b0a3f25d04ade90e0b15f27e73159f7cf1943" href="../../证据/13df7359670c7f42485010007d0b0a3f25d04ade90e0b15f27e73159f7cf1943.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13df7359670c</small></a></details><details><summary>public void RemoveNode(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ff088aad88d8d8409e0a4d415d967d2fc4b0ac692180e6de62f6c72fa4d32e69" href="../../证据/ff088aad88d8d8409e0a4d415d967d2fc4b0ac692180e6de62f6c72fa4d32e69.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ff088aad88d8</small></a></details><details><summary>public void Dispose(){</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="02ecd73394adadcadbfe782f92e3631482ad988c312710e067cd96fb94f20b57" href="../../证据/02ecd73394adadcadbfe782f92e3631482ad988c312710e067cd96fb94f20b57.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>02ecd73394ad</small></a></details><details><summary>void Release(){</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b" href="../../证据/fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fbceb2ae3ec4</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：RemoveNode与在飞执行的所有者门由宿主另核；不从State.Dispose内容直接断言泄漏，也不以root租约退出证明全部显示/历史最后读者已结束。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="CSR02"><summary>CSR02 · RemoveNode与RetainProcedureNodes批量裁剪 → 删除记录在Dispose之前完成；首个异常中断剩余裁剪</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>RemoveNode在root.gate内先删除effectiveParameters键，再从states.Remove取出value；离锁后仅当value实现IDisposable才Dispose，没有catch和RecordCleanupFailure。Dispose抛错时该node状态及参数已从这些字典移除，调用直接失败；重复RemoveNode找不到state就return，不自动重试旧对象。RetainProcedureNodes先批量删除不在keep中的全部参数键，再快照待移state键并foreach RemoveNode；其中一项抛错将中断剩余foreach，后续state仍可留在states，而其参数键可能已在第一阶段删除。</p><p>representation：节点状态字典移除、参数字典移除、对象Dispose完成分别发生，不能用一个成功/失败标记代替。</p><p>cache：没有被循环走到的state仍由root.states持有，可在之后的裁剪或root关闭进入其它清理；已移除但Dispose失败对象不由本分支自动放入failedResources。若它另被owned服务/外部持有，则还需单独判断。</p><p>release：单节点Remove/批量Retain与root Release有不同异常屏障；root Release的逐项继续保证不能外推到这两个入口。</p><details><summary>RemoveNode removes then disposes</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ff088aad88d8d8409e0a4d415d967d2fc4b0ac692180e6de62f6c72fa4d32e69" href="../../证据/ff088aad88d8d8409e0a4d415d967d2fc4b0ac692180e6de62f6c72fa4d32e69.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ff088aad88d8</small></a></details><details><summary>RetainProcedureNodes two-phase pruning</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fd003545d04d7cbe309b8965e71c44483cfb2bdcf37af963fb6bf3978a7ab2ac" href="../../证据/fd003545d04d7cbe309b8965e71c44483cfb2bdcf37af963fb6bf3978a7ab2ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fd003545d04d</small></a></details><details><summary>WPF RetainExecutionNodes caller</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="649bacd49f444bba56b31e370305693a6359a602663d27765cad1dce2840a31b" href="../../证据/649bacd49f444bba56b31e370305693a6359a602663d27765cad1dce2840a31b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>649bacd49f44</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：WPF doc.Changed等上层对传播异常如何显示/恢复需按调用者另追；本切片不宣称文档编辑或整个solution关闭必然失败。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：另列合成ScopeRetirementProbe已观测有限顺序Remove/Retain异常；并发与真实资源异常未观测，本条仍按源码关系取证。</p></details></details></article></div></details><details data-retirement-operation="solution"><summary>④ 切换方案：为什么不能只清右侧图像？</summary><div class="dd-stage-columns"><article data-retirement-side="original"><h4>原版：已证片段与未知父级桥</h4><p><strong>方案属性变更先条件关闭参数窗，再换方案装饰器；此处不直接清旧图像。</strong></p><p><strong>谁持有：</strong>A链三套仓库/选择引用与B链临时仓库独立，不能合并成一个缓存。</p><p><strong>已确认的收尾：</strong>OnSolutionChanged仅在参数窗尚未关闭时Close，再替换DecoratorSolution；旧方案分支没有直接Dispose旧装饰器。Release包装控件Dispose已证会调用内部MainViewControl.Dispose再清Content；但具体切方案/关主窗谁触发包装控件Dispose仍未知。A/B链DeInit是另外已证的局部退役体。</p><p><strong>此后仍可能存在：</strong>A链DeInit不等于生产回调停止：迟到回调仍可能进入上层计数逻辑；B链已排队任务也未由这些体排空。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：整方案切换的父级调用顺序、同一实例对应关系和最后读者需要额外证据。</p><details><summary>逐段展开成员、分支与源码</summary><details data-retirement-proof="OR01"><summary>OR01 · ProcedureConfigControl.OnSolutionChanged → 关闭当前参数窗后替换DecoratorSolution</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>Solution依赖属性变化回调先看curTabControlBase是否为IsClosing=false的BaseWindow，仅该门通过才Close当前参数窗；新方案非null时创建新的VmSolutionDecorator并设DecorateSource，否则把DecoratorSolution置null。所选体对old solution的if块为空，没有直接调用旧decorator.Dispose、ClearDataStore或图像释放。这个外层入口不可用窗口关闭名补成渲染对象全部回收。</p><p>representation：旧/新IVmSolution、参数Window与方案装饰器是不同持有者；新建装饰器不证明旧图像payload已销毁。</p><p>cache：仅更新方案装饰器引用；关闭窗口的事件尾部另见OR03，不能把两步之间未核的binding当同一图像实例链。</p><p>release：本体没有原图像free/Dispose；参数窗Close与最终图像最后读者分别保留。</p><details><summary>ProcedureConfigControl.OnSolutionChanged</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="66d97591386a9a7e00aae5a6a2080ff500e87d4c569b561f420b34d5a02e3508" href="../../证据/66d97591386a9a7e00aae5a6a2080ff500e87d4c569b561f420b34d5a02e3508.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>66d97591386a</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：当前活宿主是否发生该DP变化、窗口是否确实关闭及该窗口卸载后的显示源解绑顺序未运行确认。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：旧DecoratorSolution是否另由集合/容器清理，尚未取得完整caller到payload退出的绑定链。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="OR06"><summary>OR06 · MainViewControl.Dispose可调用入口 → 仅将其模板ModuleResultView.ModuleSource设null</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>OnApplyTemplate把m_ModuleView取为ModuleResultView，Dispose仅在mrv非null时将ModuleSource置null。该属性后续若实际发生变化，可关联已有V02的旧decorator清理；本体没有调用RenderThreadPool.ShutDown，也没有直接清所有图层/历史仓。本轮已定位Release.VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose的直接调用（OR07）；该Release.Dispose在具体退出/换方案场景中的更外层caller仍未闭合，不能宣称每次切方案/主窗关闭都必经。</p><p>representation：模板子控件引用mrv与当前ModuleSource独立；将来源设null是视图源解绑，不等于直接释放所有底层图像。</p><p>cache：若WPF判定值未变化，源变化回调是否再次发生不能由本体保证；实际场景顺序未验证。</p><p>release：仅证此可调用API局部效果，自动触发和最后像素回收均未闭合。</p><details><summary>MainViewControl.OnApplyTemplate</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0431aae4b9643d76cbdb092681e0a1fee3dd47a9ea5d0b37b1ad98c70f3a9e99" href="../../证据/0431aae4b9643d76cbdb092681e0a1fee3dd47a9ea5d0b37b1ad98c70f3a9e99.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0431aae4b964</small></a></details><details><summary>MainViewControl.Dispose</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="36b92bec24219f0e5d773fbe516505ddeebad224dbc6fe5239f3348014294ee1" href="../../证据/36b92bec24219f0e5d773fbe516505ddeebad224dbc6fe5239f3348014294ee1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>36b92bec2421</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.MainViewControl.Dispose / 0x06000182</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / actual PE MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1145a4f5f1a5532137ac46fefbd6b1a1f5ccab036134adc5a587093d9080ccca" href="../../证据/1145a4f5f1a5532137ac46fefbd6b1a1f5ccab036134adc5a587093d9080ccca.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1145a4f5f1a5</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：初始三个PE的5630个有体方法查得0直接引用，仅是有限scope；随后补入Release层986个方法并定位VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose直接调用（OR07）。它的更外层caller、224个接口候选和动态分派仍未知，不能声称每次切方案/关主窗都已释放图像。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="OR07"><summary>OR07 · Release.VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose → 退宿主事件 → MainViewControl.Dispose → Content=null</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>已恢复的Release包装层Dispose先调用自身Unloaded处理以解除方案事件，再解除RestoreDefaultDisplay，mainViewControl非null才调用其Dispose，最后Content=null。新PE扫描确认其method token 0x06000038、IL offset 40的call目标正是VMControls.WPF.MainViewControl.Dispose（MemberRef 0x0a000086），不是接口候选猜测。保留shell MainWindow.xaml实例化Release控件、该控件XAML嵌入普通MainViewControl的声明，原三份对应BAML资源已重取。</p><p>representation：shell窗口、Release用户控件、普通MainViewControl与其ModuleResultView是不同层；这个静态直接caller已接上OR06，但不把所有对象合并为一个实例。</p><p>cache：包装Dispose会撤销Content引用和方案事件订阅；不证明历史结果/排队工作或native像素最后读者已退。</p><p>release：只有实际调用该Release.Dispose后才到普通MainViewControl源解绑；它的具体更外层调用者/触发器和异常路径仍待核。</p><details><summary>VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 c016bd0a78681672a6615ceebb4bc4b9f114c4f7037771a6cd9348309655b9b6 / retained manifest MVID 5f9126e4-1370-4549-8835-ca81604c764b; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1e644c925118ae3f17116138170af6403d2bdb527dff5f6ed5ddfea834ebc508" href="../../证据/1e644c925118ae3f17116138170af6403d2bdb527dff5f6ed5ddfea834ebc508.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1e644c925118</small></a></details><details><summary>VmMainViewConfigControl_Unloaded</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 c016bd0a78681672a6615ceebb4bc4b9f114c4f7037771a6cd9348309655b9b6 / retained manifest MVID 5f9126e4-1370-4549-8835-ca81604c764b; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0211229e577d9ff61ae45adc8273dca3895c28d8c770d3cccba2477c1c901770" href="../../证据/0211229e577d9ff61ae45adc8273dca3895c28d8c770d3cccba2477c1c901770.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0211229e577d</small></a></details><details><summary>Release view embeds original MainViewControl</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 c016bd0a78681672a6615ceebb4bc4b9f114c4f7037771a6cd9348309655b9b6 / retained manifest MVID 5f9126e4-1370-4549-8835-ca81604c764b; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="34b6423d623732d1c2a1075ae89880f8c8031d53787ebef4cf55464527cc933f" href="../../证据/34b6423d623732d1c2a1075ae89880f8c8031d53787ebef4cf55464527cc933f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>34b6423d6237</small></a></details><details><summary>MainWindow embeds Release view</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 319618b9f82dfc30546c900c1c19a665e0fce1d87d2a7ffa7bb4345915b180c1 / retained manifest MVID 88823867-dc1b-476f-9133-0d8cf5da19e8; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="327e119e4c09f1db6f1ca72038df0a5358cc4f6be4f93431e56ff1078c5eb3fb" href="../../证据/327e119e4c09f1db6f1ca72038df0a5358cc4f6be4f93431e56ff1078c5eb3fb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>327e119e4c09</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.Release.VmMainViewConfigControl::Dispose / 0x06000038</summary><p>Rehashed SHA256 c016bd0a78681672a6615ceebb4bc4b9f114c4f7037771a6cd9348309655b9b6 / actual PE MVID 5f9126e4-1370-4549-8835-ca81604c764b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7381cbf37a0ed78115f422b7342f4fec3123aeaa0cd91a1b4229b4f008d0849e" href="../../证据/7381cbf37a0ed78115f422b7342f4fec3123aeaa0cd91a1b4229b4f008d0849e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7381cbf37a0e</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：谁在具体关闭主窗/切方案操作中调用Release.Dispose尚未定位，不能由XAML构造或IDisposable实现推自动调用。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：原生像素与显示最后读者、全部异常退出和主宿主实际运行顺序仍未知。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="OR08"><summary>OR08 · ResetDisposeStatus → ZoomArea SearchDryPopup.IsDisposeNotify → true通知只解除搜索控件事件，不调用图像Dispose</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ProcedureConfigControl.ResetDisposeStatus将IsDisposeNotify先true再false。保留ZoomArea.xaml将祖先ProcedureConfigControl的该属性绑定到DryPopup.IsDisposeNotify；该DP注册OnDisposeStatusChanged，只有NewValue=true才DeleteSelf。DeleteSelf解除TextBox的TextChanged/LostFocus/GotFocus、清除按钮Click及宿主Window的LocationChanged/Deactivated，再_window=null。所选完整体没有调用MainViewControl.Dispose，不清图像或模块结果；这条通知不能再被当成图像释放触发器。</p><p>representation：搜索弹窗、其宿主Window事件引用、MainViewControl图像来源和结果仓分开。</p><p>cache：退搜索事件仅影响所列订阅；DeleteSelf本体也没有清SearchResultCollection或销毁渲染仓的合同。</p><p>release：这一个已定位消费者的局部事件退役已证；其余消费者、模板活绑定及像素最后读者均另列。</p><details><summary>ProcedureConfigControl.ResetDisposeStatus</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3375484b483239e0751c17bca2580121e8e95cb7cfb59ad9a9e19160d03676be" href="../../证据/3375484b483239e0751c17bca2580121e8e95cb7cfb59ad9a9e19160d03676be.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3375484b4832</small></a></details><details><summary>ZoomArea SearchDryPopup.IsDisposeNotify binding</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fdf6f7ea70fb89883a6856e1060489ce7ec6a3692d54af0631acea42bcd0100c" href="../../证据/fdf6f7ea70fb89883a6856e1060489ce7ec6a3692d54af0631acea42bcd0100c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fdf6f7ea70fb</small></a></details><details><summary>SearchDryPopup.IsDisposeNotify registration</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="435b9009f142317bc6ab4da9a1d4da3b33f4bab34e2e0fe78f9628d74d31ca82" href="../../证据/435b9009f142317bc6ab4da9a1d4da3b33f4bab34e2e0fe78f9628d74d31ca82.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>435b9009f142</small></a></details><details><summary>SearchDryPopup.OnDisposeStatusChanged and DeleteSelf</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="027e1e5619a259e94d10d13d58c00dceebd323a96eca915ff4b20b805744b306" href="../../证据/027e1e5619a259e94d10d13d58c00dceebd323a96eca915ff4b20b805744b306.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>027e1e5619a2</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：当前只闭合一个静态模板消费者；原模板是否在特定宿主激活、其它IsDisposeNotify消费者与重复模板应用生命周期未穷举。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="RC04"><summary>RC04 · ClearDisplayStore / Init / DeInit → 仅清当前display、清三仓及迟到回调的边界</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ClearDisplayStore仅Clear当前display图像/图形字典，不改buffer/spare、三个计数、两个固定标志或SelectedImage等选择引用。Init只设isInit=true。DeInit则设isInit=false，Clear三套图像/图形字典，清计数和固定标志，置CheckImagesName/SelectedImage/SelectedInputImage为空；没有逐图Dispose或像素free。SetRenderDataToStore以isInit阻止继续入值，但SetDataToStore本身并未先检查isInit：反初始化后迟到的有效回调仍可更新仓库计数和走Clear，然后在下层不存值。所以DeInit不等同所有生产回调已经停止或排空。</p><p>representation：清仓、清选择身份、禁止下层存值、原生像素释放是四个不同层次；A链ModuleResultView另持有的ImageData不由此字段写入直接清掉。</p><p>cache：ClearDisplayStore仍保留两待写仓里的旧图；DeInit删除三仓持有，但已交给装饰器、视图或扩展消费者的对象可继续可达。</p><p>release：所选清理体没有调用ImageData.Dispose、FreeHGlobal或共享映射关闭；不能用DeInit的完成代替最后读者和所有像素已释放的证据。</p><details><summary>public void ClearDisplayStore()</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9dfdc6e88917df22aa767bba9224c59f9310e9ae411914e3d226142b79076ecf" href="../../证据/9dfdc6e88917df22aa767bba9224c59f9310e9ae411914e3d226142b79076ecf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9dfdc6e88917</small></a></details><details><summary>public void Init()</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="910f799075bb238e56c41844ac5bb0ff53e40938b44941a317a8de903f057cf2" href="../../证据/910f799075bb238e56c41844ac5bb0ff53e40938b44941a317a8de903f057cf2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>910f799075bb</small></a></details><details><summary>public void DeInit()</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4119f226ce97808b04ee46443250f6e4d6ae12953659bee3e485b9f31ad23e42" href="../../证据/4119f226ce97808b04ee46443250f6e4d6ae12953659bee3e485b9f31ad23e42.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4119f226ce97</small></a></details><details><summary>public void SetDataToStore(</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d2098082e0ba811f958441d3b1c94c72080086d8abeda85f96f507340e9eb3d" href="../../证据/0d2098082e0ba811f958441d3b1c94c72080086d8abeda85f96f507340e9eb3d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d2098082e0b</small></a></details><details><summary>private void SetRenderDataToStore(</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bb787362f3f60cc2eca9784e9377a135b040cb61c81a2304af095ffa2ce132ac" href="../../证据/bb787362f3f60cc2eca9784e9377a135b040cb61c81a2304af095ffa2ce132ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bb787362f3f6</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::ClearDisplayStore</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2dab3ce386c5cdd8936ba2893c26bd5a9df2302492d1c1847d3f6b05d4a9e792" href="../../证据/2dab3ce386c5cdd8936ba2893c26bd5a9df2302492d1c1847d3f6b05d4a9e792.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2dab3ce386c5</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::DeInit</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cb340b8a33164e25592f527c23b4fb6ca600d3347037e5f19067e60c79fb2b95" href="../../证据/cb340b8a33164e25592f527c23b4fb6ca600d3347037e5f19067e60c79fb2b95.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cb340b8a3316</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::Init</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="aeb564366760ee8d7a09e3269f25f302bfcc439ce5884fc9e8a19bdb3813037b" href="../../证据/aeb564366760ee8d7a09e3269f25f302bfcc439ce5884fc9e8a19bdb3813037b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>aeb564366760</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：三仓只属于RenderDataCenter→ModuleResultView/ModuleDisplayDecorator的A链；不得归到没有引用RenderDataCenter的RenderControlBase/tempImageStore B链。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：原机异步排空、外部消费者、图像/位图与native资源最终释放仍未验证。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="RB06"><summary>RB06 · 图像选择清空 / ClearImageView / DeInitRenderControl → 临时仓库和显示引用退役分开</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>imageListCombobox_SelectionChanged在SelectedValue为空时清扩展图形、ShapeList、初始化imageView并将ImageDataSource=null；ClearImageView主图分支也经UpdateImageView(null)清背景引用。DeInitRenderControl则解除显示对象事件/过滤，ModuleParams=null，Dispose图像列表装饰器并分别在锁中清tempImageStore/tempShapeStore，解绑renderStatusModule并减SubscribeCount。该方法没有把ImageDataSource置null，也没有逐图像Dispose，故仓库反初始化、UI清空和原生像素释放不能当作同一个动作。</p><p>representation：控件属性、临时字典、图像列表和事件订阅分别持有或关联对象。</p><p>cache：清空选择与更换模块走不同退役入口；DeInit本身不证明所有显示引用都清空。</p><p>release：装饰器Dispose负责其列表/事件；没有因此证明共享内存生产者或WPF位图已最终销毁。</p><details><summary>private void imageListCombobox_SelectionChanged(</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ab65074ed2ac677a753c19c00fefc1dbe8919aeeb2ea365da4fa1e1f9d9e34e3" href="../../证据/ab65074ed2ac677a753c19c00fefc1dbe8919aeeb2ea365da4fa1e1f9d9e34e3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ab65074ed2ac</small></a></details><details><summary>public void ClearImageView(</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016" href="../../证据/2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2860cadca62d</small></a></details><details><summary>private void UpdateImageView(</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5379587232315e1f33543cbba588658f77897de9d75ee679c24419648fc8651f" href="../../证据/5379587232315e1f33543cbba588658f77897de9d75ee679c24419648fc8651f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>537958723231</small></a></details><details><summary>private void DeInitRenderControl(</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da" href="../../证据/87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>87cd0d7f2ace</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::DeInitRenderControl / 0x0600033c</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bd54f79e142f125a655c4d07e9310e85bb8a245d4d63a47aebeeec9d3c7ab8cc" href="../../证据/bd54f79e142f125a655c4d07e9310e85bb8a245d4d63a47aebeeec9d3c7ab8cc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bd54f79e142f</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：所有Unloaded/模块更换/异常路径是否在飞任务排空后才释放仍未闭合；不从Dispose名称推断最后读者结束。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：源ImageData、imageView内部转换器位图和图形扩展的最终持有者仍须分别核对。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="IF05"><summary>IF05 · ClearImageView / RenderControlBase_Unloaded / DeInitRenderControl → 清引用、退委托不撤销已经排队的工作</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>已核选定ClearImageView调用Init/UpdateImageView(null)或清输入图属性，Unloaded退掉OnSetImageEnd与OnFreshExtendContent委托，DeInitRenderControl解除显示事件/过滤并清临时字典。对应CIL中没有等待此前两条Task.Run返回句柄、DispatcherOperation.Abort或取消token操作；Task调用点又没有保留该句柄。这些动作因此不能作为已排队闭包不再持有控件、不能再读当前状态/调用更新的证明。下一次源为空的ImageViewBox回调仍是自己的同步清显示/通知旧新图像事件链，不构成上游工作排空屏障。</p><p>representation：清空控件属性与排队闭包的强引用是两套可达关系；旧工作仍可通过this访问当前属性/仓库。</p><p>cache：清临时仓库不销毁控件实例，且其它路径可能在其后重新赋ImageDataSource。这里只界定缺少哪一种排空保证，不断言必然覆盖新帧。</p><p>release：退订阻止后续相关事件接入，不撤回已经创建的Task/Dispatcher委托；最后读者与像素释放仍需宿主层关闭协议和运行证据。</p><details><summary>public void ClearImageView(</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016" href="../../证据/2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2860cadca62d</small></a></details><details><summary>private void RenderControlBase_Unloaded(</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e39cf2e044e0798f1f795a7adc873a3db241477cdcfdd684cbff470edd83ea3d" href="../../证据/e39cf2e044e0798f1f795a7adc873a3db241477cdcfdd684cbff470edd83ea3d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e39cf2e044e0</small></a></details><details><summary>private void DeInitRenderControl(</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da" href="../../证据/87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>87cd0d7f2ace</small></a></details><details><summary>private static void ImageSourceChanged(</summary><p>SHA256 d3ed7ce6cca860ac89d671dc0fe4ee239a97063d18bed94d3ad97595d5d52555 / MVID 47136107-aecc-42c7-bdbd-a8641253cae6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="78da8122f6161c9aa648708613f025f50a4209a1f42aabe26f6c313a94a2e957" href="../../证据/78da8122f6161c9aa648708613f025f50a4209a1f42aabe26f6c313a94a2e957.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>78da8122f616</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::ClearImageView / 0x06000345</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a08ab0b721c33446e242502cf2c4106f1e0d38598500426ddc2f545580f7b747" href="../../证据/a08ab0b721c33446e242502cf2c4106f1e0d38598500426ddc2f545580f7b747.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a08ab0b721c3</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::RenderControlBase_Unloaded / 0x06000338</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d70a3f93d6248c0e21e63579ce85439cfe4021c3f9e5ea13e84e9afb111c08b3" href="../../证据/d70a3f93d6248c0e21e63579ce85439cfe4021c3f9e5ea13e84e9afb111c08b3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d70a3f93d624</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::DeInitRenderControl / 0x0600033c</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b970a4656f4def286a3239e695f0526a178ef6053f39264e9cc12eb5f24e58da" href="../../证据/b970a4656f4def286a3239e695f0526a178ef6053f39264e9cc12eb5f24e58da.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b970a4656f4d</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：不能仅凭选定体没有取消调用断言原程序全局不存在排空；进程/父窗口关闭及其它所有者仍需独立追踪。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：未观察原机清空/卸载与回调竞争，实际过期呈现、异常或内存滞留是否发生及概率均未知。</p></details></details></article><article data-retirement-side="current"><h4>当前：独立实现</h4><p><strong>切方案同时撤销旧结果发布资格、清宿主结果仓，再退役旧scope。</strong></p><p><strong>谁持有：</strong>执行owner负责准入，宿主结果仓持有记录，scope及其租约负责资源退役。</p><p><strong>已确认的收尾：</strong>ReplaceExecutionScope使旧owner失效并取消请求，清调试/配置/流程结果等，再Dispose旧scope并创建新scope；旧scope等待取消完成且租约归零后Release。</p><p><strong>此后仍可能存在：</strong>scope清字典并Dispose其拥有的可释放资源；失败资源另留failedResources。外部结果或调用者仍可能持有图像。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：这不证明外部历史、消费者和托管像素都在同一时刻消失。</p><details><summary>逐段展开成员、分支与源码</summary><details data-retirement-proof="CR06"><summary>CR06 · 切方案 / 关闭主窗 → 先阻止旧owner发布，scope等待租约；主窗关闭不等于全持有者清零</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>切方案ReplaceExecutionScope先使执行owner失效、取消当前请求，显式Clear调试记录、configurationResults、workflowSessions、results等，再Dispose旧scope并创建新scope。scope.Dispose先closing并Cancel，只有取消完成且leases==0才Release；Release清state/services/参数字典，再逐个Dispose可释放资源，失败资源额外存failedResources。主窗关闭与切方案不同：DrainWorkflowBeforeClose先取消活动流程并等activeRun换出；独立调试session由OnClosing等停。OnClosed关闭owner/回调队列、关配置并Dispose scope，但该体没有Clear workflowSessions/results/configurationResults或逐个清控件图像。只可说关闭启动退役，不能说所有外部对象已同步归零。</p><p>representation：scope的租约控制state/services清理；NodeRunRecord与WPF/工具显示引用不由同一引用计数统一管理。</p><p>cache：失败资源被保留用于CleanupFailures诊断；旧在飞方法局部引用、关闭窗口/context、外部消费者与结果Task可另外保持载荷可达。FrameworkRunHistory只存摘要（TD08），不能把它当图像历史释放机制。</p><p>release：新owner阻止旧结果进入新方案，但不是销毁所有旧像素；窗口生命周期、scope清理、查询容器释放和最后图像读者退出需分别说明。</p><details><summary> void ReplaceExecutionScope()</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="059edbdec78959762068e303ec96ee8bd8b5949dbf1185a4cdc704bd690f8403" href="../../证据/059edbdec78959762068e303ec96ee8bd8b5949dbf1185a4cdc704bd690f8403.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>059edbdec789</small></a></details><details><summary> public void Dispose(){</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4e8fd932d9bb3193cfa517bfb3fe01d6ac384e05ebb94607f447b5bf750a6daf" href="../../证据/4e8fd932d9bb3193cfa517bfb3fe01d6ac384e05ebb94607f447b5bf750a6daf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4e8fd932d9bb</small></a></details><details><summary> void Release(){</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b" href="../../证据/fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fbceb2ae3ec4</small></a></details><details><summary> void RecordCleanupFailure(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="667d84c52f018741334ebe41c9094af0e41b74238b795cd1b7c240d6bab018be" href="../../证据/667d84c52f018741334ebe41c9094af0e41b74238b795cd1b7c240d6bab018be.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>667d84c52f01</small></a></details><details><summary> async void DrainWorkflowBeforeClose(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6be2984eb8a0ced82e645ad5b341ff9f2eeff1bd91922706f00d68bb58b4a1fb" href="../../证据/6be2984eb8a0ced82e645ad5b341ff9f2eeff1bd91922706f00d68bb58b4a1fb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6be2984eb8a0</small></a></details><details><summary> protected override async void OnClosing(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f6d959502fe59ffd5b4afa4b8b044e17cc3b1da9af33f62790bf710c6339e797" href="../../证据/f6d959502fe59ffd5b4afa4b8b044e17cc3b1da9af33f62790bf710c6339e797.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f6d959502fe5</small></a></details><details><summary> protected override void OnClosed(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9244b0ac6bbc3cfbdf8dc4d39210323edbd9c04dc225ccac1177ba978d7fea8b" href="../../证据/9244b0ac6bbc3cfbdf8dc4d39210323edbd9c04dc225ccac1177ba978d7fea8b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9244b0ac6bbc</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：没有强制GC、原机内存峰值或最终外部读者测量；不得由静态Dispose路径推断释放的精确时刻、无泄漏或native等价。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="TD07"><summary>TD07 · IToolDisplayProvider.LastDisplay → 三presenter → frame持有 / 图像层位图 / 文本和结果投影</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>RefreshToolDisplay按请求代次、execution owner和当前流程判Current，先Show(null)清旧显示，再在node有结果且实现provider时取frame；Current通过后把同一frame传给图像、记录和结果列表presenter。图像presenter把Frame字段设为frame，清文字/几何children与旧image.Source/图像层，然后按选中图像和勾选层重建WPF图像。Bitmap辅助函数同样Pixels.ToArray→BitmapSource.Create→Freeze。记录presenter只取RecordText，列表presenter把ResultList投影为一个字典行；不能把这两者说成持有相同的整帧字段。</p><p>representation：image presenter.Frame保留完整ToolDisplayFrame；各图像层另有BitmapSource副本；TextBlock/表行是另一种投影。</p><p>cache：清frame后尺寸归1；provider可能仍持有最近输出。最多三勾选图像层及文字/图形按frame重建。</p><p>release：Show(null)置Frame=null并移除该presenter的图像/标签引用，不调用frame.Image.Dispose或清provider缓存；同一图像的其它持有者继续有效。</p><details><summary>long request=++toolDisplayRequestGeneration</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="011023208dd4062299060f59880a42a7b6c3a347c961a8082a16f314694d4cd0" href="../../证据/011023208dd4062299060f59880a42a7b6c3a347c961a8082a16f314694d4cd0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>011023208dd4</small></a></details><details><summary>Frame = frame; labels.Children.Clear(); image.Source = null;</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5c262edb8d5033f223006a465497bad17a1acb92da5c65898c4b6fe51b506a17" href="../../证据/5c262edb8d5033f223006a465497bad17a1acb92da5c65898c4b6fe51b506a17.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5c262edb8d50</small></a></details><details><summary>var selectedLayer=frame.SelectedImageName</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="187a9b03f59713dabc98ef98fbd993721025a132f378bb576a3df9eb4d8dbd02" href="../../证据/187a9b03f59713dabc98ef98fbd993721025a132f378bb576a3df9eb4d8dbd02.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>187a9b03f597</small></a></details><details><summary>public void Show(ToolDisplayFrame? frame) { Text</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d83ceb0af29dbefc84e08ee90d7f67f206a59ced14a87db29e445ec9f42c2cc" href="../../证据/0d83ceb0af29dbefc84e08ee90d7f67f206a59ced14a87db29e445ec9f42c2cc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d83ceb0af29</small></a></details><details><summary>Columns.Clear(); ItemsSource = null;</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f4570afb88fcff97092854091ef3fef6e654e2d4ab2518e002cc9add9732b19c" href="../../证据/f4570afb88fcff97092854091ef3fef6e654e2d4ab2518e002cc9add9732b19c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f4570afb88fc</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：不因Current门或Freeze推断所有生产者线程安全；原版文字/几何/native图像的最后读者和生命周期仍独立核对。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="CSR03"><summary>CSR03 · root closing置位与API准入 / 租约 → 立即拒新状态与租约，不等于所有查询/删除都禁用</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>root Dispose在gate下先设置closing=true再调用stopping.Cancel；State&lt;T>、RegisterService、Enter与参数Parameters入口均以closing抛ObjectDisposedException。与之不同，Service&lt;T>只锁gate查询，无closing检查：若活跃租约阻止Release清字典，它仍可在closing期间返回旧服务；Release清空后则返回null。ForProcedure只验证procedure字符串，可以继续生成borrowed view；RequestRun/RequestRefresh在closing直接返回。RemoveNode与RetainProcedureNodes没有closing或leases门，故root完整Release等待租约不能被概括成任何节点移除/替换都受同一租约保护。</p><p>representation：closing是操作级准入状态；cancellationComplete与leases控制root Release时机。借用view的存在本身不证明其API可继续使用。</p><p>cache：在Release前states/services可能仍保留；State即使只是想取已有值也先拒绝，Service查询则未使用同样策略。</p><p>release：Enter取得的Lease仅参与root TryRelease；Lease自身Interlocked.Exchange确保一次Exit。它不替代调用者在RemoveNode等入口的并发协调。</p><details><summary>State&lt;T> closing gate</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b70c7dfc27c1831ec0c54986c719bacb2e6064766684a2425b3188e5d8c7446c" href="../../证据/b70c7dfc27c1831ec0c54986c719bacb2e6064766684a2425b3188e5d8c7446c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b70c7dfc27c1</small></a></details><details><summary>RegisterService and Service asymmetry</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b3568c9a7737fce55bd04f55f551e668924c85e43e247aa44d896525d087131e" href="../../证据/b3568c9a7737fce55bd04f55f551e668924c85e43e247aa44d896525d087131e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b3568c9a7737</small></a></details><details><summary>ForProcedure borrowed view construction</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9af9ceff47aa44aa1272f50a0c6141d393421d9080eb4221f686ec047ef1f97d" href="../../证据/9af9ceff47aa44aa1272f50a0c6141d393421d9080eb4221f686ec047ef1f97d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9af9ceff47aa</small></a></details><details><summary>RequestRun and RequestRefresh closing return</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="07915e3685efb2856e87527487a856905e5a7d0e119618882b5cfead1b861932" href="../../证据/07915e3685efb2856e87527487a856905e5a7d0e119618882b5cfead1b861932.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>07915e3685ef</small></a></details><details><summary>Enter and RemoveNode guards differ</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="107ef872276da6c4d33e93d24646cc63e010650c4331e482387587e321c05994" href="../../证据/107ef872276da6c4d33e93d24646cc63e010650c4331e482387587e321c05994.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>107ef872276d</small></a></details><details><summary>Dispose/TryRelease/Exit</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4e8fd932d9bb3193cfa517bfb3fe01d6ac384e05ebb94607f447b5bf750a6daf" href="../../证据/4e8fd932d9bb3193cfa517bfb3fe01d6ac384e05ebb94607f447b5bf750a6daf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4e8fd932d9bb</small></a></details><details><summary>Effective parameter closing gate</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0b3d70d24c37752cfb43fca518915b9c500c26d7db1a300a2a2d4d57c0808956" href="../../证据/0b3d70d24c37752cfb43fca518915b9c500c26d7db1a300a2a2d4d57c0808956.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0b3d70d24c37</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：代码未给出所有方法的全域并发安全保证；不将允许调用某查询/Remove的事实解释为对资源在用状态必然安全。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：stopping.Token在CancellationTokenSource已Dispose之后的外部访问合同未在这里运行验证，不作应用级行为推断。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="CSR04"><summary>CSR04 · 取消或资源Dispose异常后的root Dispose / Lease.Exit → root清理是一次性尝试；failedResources保留不等于排队重试</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Dispose设置closing后，stopping.Cancel抛Exception会RecordCleanupFailure(cancel,stopping,error)，finally仍设置cancellationComplete并TryRelease；不是因取消回调异常就跳过该finally。TryRelease要求closing、cancellationComplete、leases==0且!releaseStarted，在真正Release前置releaseStarted=true。Release对各IDisposable的Exception分别记录后继续下一资源，并单独尝试stopping.Dispose；这点现有CR06已有，本事实新增明确重试边界：root重复Dispose因closing立即return，后续Exit也因releaseStarted不再启动第二遍，failedResources只保留对象，所选类没有重试/清空该表的方法。</p><p>representation：CleanupFailures getter返回失败记录数组副本；内部failedResources保存真实资源引用。诊断快照与资源持有是两层。</p><p>cache：失败对象及其Exception可继续使资源图可达；保留到root仍可达不等于资源已释放，也不等于有后台重试任务。</p><p>release：Release前先清states/有效参数/services/ownedServices，失败不会把原索引恢复。普通单项Dispose抛Exception不会阻断后续项；但分配快照、RecordCleanupFailure自身异常或进程级故障等未被这一逐资源catch覆盖。</p><details><summary>Dispose cancellation catch and finally</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="02ecd73394adadcadbfe782f92e3631482ad988c312710e067cd96fb94f20b57" href="../../证据/02ecd73394adadcadbfe782f92e3631482ad988c312710e067cd96fb94f20b57.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>02ecd73394ad</small></a></details><details><summary>TryRelease once-only gate</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="72db19d30e20a46eec751d69f739869910654f19a0f7de0d83b7a4e63df74a60" href="../../证据/72db19d30e20a46eec751d69f739869910654f19a0f7de0d83b7a4e63df74a60.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>72db19d30e20</small></a></details><details><summary>Exit can trigger final release</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f8ca4e658a43e85ba68d55bf16d6ce8c43293c07089fdb1f9e2854aa5a3b34de" href="../../证据/f8ca4e658a43e85ba68d55bf16d6ce8c43293c07089fdb1f9e2854aa5a3b34de.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f8ca4e658a43</small></a></details><details><summary>Release catches each resource and token</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b" href="../../证据/fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fbceb2ae3ec4</small></a></details><details><summary>Diagnostic snapshot and actual failed object retention</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="62e552a2c3645bbeb9d712b2c3ae8d70a647bde8ebe5dfd80ae3d0cb5aceba9d" href="../../证据/62e552a2c3645bbeb9d712b2c3ae8d70a647bde8ebe5dfd80ae3d0cb5aceba9d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>62e552a2c364</small></a></details><details><summary>releaseStarted and closing fields</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="802be731c5ac6e255baee00602bf6d6a3680df36bfafa4d18628ba85983e0c72" href="../../证据/802be731c5ac6e255baee00602bf6d6a3680df36bfafa4d18628ba85983e0c72.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>802be731c5ac</small></a></details><details><summary>Lease exits once</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1e55e375b9038794e05eb7ab59d4278d46a36f4890c92dc633e436e1a3cdfa31" href="../../证据/1e55e375b9038794e05eb7ab59d4278d46a36f4890c92dc633e436e1a3cdfa31.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1e55e375b903</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：不把源码Exception catch扩大为任何OOM、进程退出或任意RecordCleanupFailure自身失败时也必完整清理。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：本条是源码静态事实；另列合成ScopeRetirementProbe验证有限异常与重复Dispose。GC、真实资源/GUI/设备及native释放未观测，不以幂等调用门推成功释放/原版等价。</p></details></details></article></div></details><details data-retirement-operation="window"><summary>⑤ 关闭主窗口：退出请求是否就是所有数据已释放？</summary><div class="dd-stage-columns"><article data-retirement-side="original"><h4>原版：已证片段与未知父级桥</h4><p><strong>应用退出已追到Dispose(bool)向SDK提交销毁请求；请求之后的原生排空仍未知。</strong></p><p><strong>谁持有：</strong>显示仓库、控件转换位图、排队通知、查询页与native生产缓冲各有自己的寿命。</p><p><strong>已确认的收尾：</strong>应用退出调用VmSolution.Dispose(isRunBackground)，其bool重载交DestoryHandle(0/1)；与SDKMode无参Dispose的DestoryThirdHandle等待路径分开。OwnerWin_Closed/DeInit及查询Release是其它独立的收尾片段。</p><p><strong>此后仍可能存在：</strong>查询Release未在原列表内置零或清列表，返回码也未检查；不能据此称重复Release安全，更不能证明所有显示消费者已结束。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：主窗父级退出到所有图像读者和原生生产者结束仍未完成同实例证明。</p><details><summary>逐段展开成员、分支与源码</summary><details data-retirement-proof="OR05"><summary>OR05 · VmSolution.Dispose(bool isTakeOver) → 向VmInterfaceManager.DestoryHandle传0或1</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>现有应用退出已有L17调用VmSolution.Dispose(isRunBackground)。本轮只补到该bool重载的实际体：记录DestoryHandle日志，然后调用mVmInterfaceManager.DestoryHandle(isTakeOver?1:0)。无参Dispose还有SDKMode的DestoryThirdHandle任务+SyncWaitor路径，另一路base.Dispose后调用bool重载并设置IsDispose；不能把这些重载自动当同一退出模式。</p><p>representation：后台接管参数、SDKMode路径、应用退出与托管渲染仓是不同边界。</p><p>cache：bool重载本体没有枚举图像或显示结果缓存；原/native handle释放和托管最后读者需要分列。</p><p>release：确认SDK销毁请求的具体实参，不能由DestoryHandle名称推定像素/位图全部释放或所有回调已排空。</p><details><summary>VmSolution.Dispose overloads</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / retained manifest MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0a3f5530efb9f56b35bfa7ad7170731d57c50b4dae70ef188cfaa13e7d1afb63" href="../../证据/0a3f5530efb9f56b35bfa7ad7170731d57c50b4dae70ef188cfaa13e7d1afb63.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0a3f5530efb9</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：VmInterfaceManager.DestoryHandle原生接收体、后台接管实际存活资源、异步回调全部停止时点未取，本轮不启动原版。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="OR07"><summary>OR07 · Release.VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose → 退宿主事件 → MainViewControl.Dispose → Content=null</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>已恢复的Release包装层Dispose先调用自身Unloaded处理以解除方案事件，再解除RestoreDefaultDisplay，mainViewControl非null才调用其Dispose，最后Content=null。新PE扫描确认其method token 0x06000038、IL offset 40的call目标正是VMControls.WPF.MainViewControl.Dispose（MemberRef 0x0a000086），不是接口候选猜测。保留shell MainWindow.xaml实例化Release控件、该控件XAML嵌入普通MainViewControl的声明，原三份对应BAML资源已重取。</p><p>representation：shell窗口、Release用户控件、普通MainViewControl与其ModuleResultView是不同层；这个静态直接caller已接上OR06，但不把所有对象合并为一个实例。</p><p>cache：包装Dispose会撤销Content引用和方案事件订阅；不证明历史结果/排队工作或native像素最后读者已退。</p><p>release：只有实际调用该Release.Dispose后才到普通MainViewControl源解绑；它的具体更外层调用者/触发器和异常路径仍待核。</p><details><summary>VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 c016bd0a78681672a6615ceebb4bc4b9f114c4f7037771a6cd9348309655b9b6 / retained manifest MVID 5f9126e4-1370-4549-8835-ca81604c764b; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1e644c925118ae3f17116138170af6403d2bdb527dff5f6ed5ddfea834ebc508" href="../../证据/1e644c925118ae3f17116138170af6403d2bdb527dff5f6ed5ddfea834ebc508.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1e644c925118</small></a></details><details><summary>VmMainViewConfigControl_Unloaded</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 c016bd0a78681672a6615ceebb4bc4b9f114c4f7037771a6cd9348309655b9b6 / retained manifest MVID 5f9126e4-1370-4549-8835-ca81604c764b; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0211229e577d9ff61ae45adc8273dca3895c28d8c770d3cccba2477c1c901770" href="../../证据/0211229e577d9ff61ae45adc8273dca3895c28d8c770d3cccba2477c1c901770.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0211229e577d</small></a></details><details><summary>Release view embeds original MainViewControl</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 c016bd0a78681672a6615ceebb4bc4b9f114c4f7037771a6cd9348309655b9b6 / retained manifest MVID 5f9126e4-1370-4549-8835-ca81604c764b; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="34b6423d623732d1c2a1075ae89880f8c8031d53787ebef4cf55464527cc933f" href="../../证据/34b6423d623732d1c2a1075ae89880f8c8031d53787ebef4cf55464527cc933f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>34b6423d6237</small></a></details><details><summary>MainWindow embeds Release view</summary><p>Rehashed original SHA256 319618b9f82dfc30546c900c1c19a665e0fce1d87d2a7ffa7bb4345915b180c1 / retained manifest MVID 88823867-dc1b-476f-9133-0d8cf5da19e8; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="327e119e4c09f1db6f1ca72038df0a5358cc4f6be4f93431e56ff1078c5eb3fb" href="../../证据/327e119e4c09f1db6f1ca72038df0a5358cc4f6be4f93431e56ff1078c5eb3fb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>327e119e4c09</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.Release.VmMainViewConfigControl::Dispose / 0x06000038</summary><p>Rehashed SHA256 c016bd0a78681672a6615ceebb4bc4b9f114c4f7037771a6cd9348309655b9b6 / actual PE MVID 5f9126e4-1370-4549-8835-ca81604c764b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7381cbf37a0ed78115f422b7342f4fec3123aeaa0cd91a1b4229b4f008d0849e" href="../../证据/7381cbf37a0ed78115f422b7342f4fec3123aeaa0cd91a1b4229b4f008d0849e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7381cbf37a0e</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：谁在具体关闭主窗/切方案操作中调用Release.Dispose尚未定位，不能由XAML构造或IDisposable实现推自动调用。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：原生像素与显示最后读者、全部异常退出和主宿主实际运行顺序仍未知。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="RS05"><summary>RS05 · 模块切换 / OwnerWin_Closed / 装饰器Dispose → 清图像字段、退订事件、清缓存与原始像素寿命分列</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>OwnerWin_Closed把ModuleSource设null，普通模块切换DoSourceChanged会Dispose旧m_CurrentInfo并置null。装饰器Dispose退订流程/模块、输入和显示对象事件，在Dispatcher调用ParentUI.ClearModuleView，再清dataRecords/ShapeList/ResultData、DeInitImageList、停RecordTimer并RenderDataCenter.DeInit。ClearModuleView调用UpdateImageView(null)，普通校验分支进ClearImage，将装饰器.ImageDataSource与curImageData置null；同时清图形/数据网格/图层。上述选定方法没有逐像素Free、共享内存映射释放或ImageData.Dispose调用，因此只能证明各自持有/订阅退出，不能据此断言所有原生像素或已生成位图立即释放。</p><p>representation：装饰器、视图curImageData、ImageViewBox依赖属性、数据中心字典和显示位图是不同持有层；断开这些引用的时间点并非一个。</p><p>cache：切模块释放旧装饰器并建新装饰器；Owner窗口关闭触发置ModuleSource为空；ResultViewAddition扩展仍有独立清理行为。</p><p>release：清图像字段/集合与DeInit是可见收尾步骤，最后原生读者、GC回收和WPF位图内部资源释放仍须另证；不据Dispose名称宣称无泄漏或绝对安全。</p><details><summary>private void OwnerWin_Closed(</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="77eba1381c18ae333c336303e627b674a27b8d40c057c3b62f64ce5f6f65c5ea" href="../../证据/77eba1381c18ae333c336303e627b674a27b8d40c057c3b62f64ce5f6f65c5ea.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>77eba1381c18</small></a></details><details><summary>private void DoSourceChanged(</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6a0665aa30cc6ecd36b589302074079e86f81edb1b0c1c0db4cd2e365000aa61" href="../../证据/6a0665aa30cc6ecd36b589302074079e86f81edb1b0c1c0db4cd2e365000aa61.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6a0665aa30cc</small></a></details><details><summary>public void Dispose()</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3aa76a52b3939a782ed147194741829f4e3a27a60e5e0a174a80bee7107ab459" href="../../证据/3aa76a52b3939a782ed147194741829f4e3a27a60e5e0a174a80bee7107ab459.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3aa76a52b393</small></a></details><details><summary>public void ClearModuleView()</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="58bb804df3e53c239e7a121254001fb01e87ec2215a8a6abc044f44e7bf953fc" href="../../证据/58bb804df3e53c239e7a121254001fb01e87ec2215a8a6abc044f44e7bf953fc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>58bb804df3e5</small></a></details><details><summary>public void ClearImage()</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0238d62ec5416cb8b1cdfcaf9326ab4aeced0f9988b6e041d13037ec111d02e7" href="../../证据/0238d62ec5416cb8b1cdfcaf9326ab4aeced0f9988b6e041d13037ec111d02e7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0238d62ec541</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.ModuleDisplayDecorator::Dispose</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2b50786594b412238a248c254d15b9bca86a6039f0eb8ababaa55035c38b0bab" href="../../证据/2b50786594b412238a248c254d15b9bca86a6039f0eb8ababaa55035c38b0bab.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2b50786594b4</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::ClearImage</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="07ec8671b64589b6cc6d740f35c9c03a6c60b9858519bdf4278b6dd7be01bffe" href="../../证据/07ec8671b64589b6cc6d740f35c9c03a6c60b9858519bdf4278b6dd7be01bffe.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>07ec8671b645</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::OwnerWin_Closed</summary><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f8931fd1ab774876025fc99df65c91318bce22229f27e674c4bc2ef00800ff88" href="../../证据/f8931fd1ab774876025fc99df65c91318bce22229f27e674c4bc2ef00800ff88.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f8931fd1ab77</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：ResultViewAddition.CheckUpdateImageView/OnModuleCallBackArrived可改变清空/呈现分支，扩展组件全部行为未闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：未确认原程序关闭/切换时所有异步工作、消费者与native buffer的最后读者；不得声称本次做过原机内存回收验收。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="IF05"><summary>IF05 · ClearImageView / RenderControlBase_Unloaded / DeInitRenderControl → 清引用、退委托不撤销已经排队的工作</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>已核选定ClearImageView调用Init/UpdateImageView(null)或清输入图属性，Unloaded退掉OnSetImageEnd与OnFreshExtendContent委托，DeInitRenderControl解除显示事件/过滤并清临时字典。对应CIL中没有等待此前两条Task.Run返回句柄、DispatcherOperation.Abort或取消token操作；Task调用点又没有保留该句柄。这些动作因此不能作为已排队闭包不再持有控件、不能再读当前状态/调用更新的证明。下一次源为空的ImageViewBox回调仍是自己的同步清显示/通知旧新图像事件链，不构成上游工作排空屏障。</p><p>representation：清空控件属性与排队闭包的强引用是两套可达关系；旧工作仍可通过this访问当前属性/仓库。</p><p>cache：清临时仓库不销毁控件实例，且其它路径可能在其后重新赋ImageDataSource。这里只界定缺少哪一种排空保证，不断言必然覆盖新帧。</p><p>release：退订阻止后续相关事件接入，不撤回已经创建的Task/Dispatcher委托；最后读者与像素释放仍需宿主层关闭协议和运行证据。</p><details><summary>public void ClearImageView(</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016" href="../../证据/2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2860cadca62d</small></a></details><details><summary>private void RenderControlBase_Unloaded(</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e39cf2e044e0798f1f795a7adc873a3db241477cdcfdd684cbff470edd83ea3d" href="../../证据/e39cf2e044e0798f1f795a7adc873a3db241477cdcfdd684cbff470edd83ea3d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e39cf2e044e0</small></a></details><details><summary>private void DeInitRenderControl(</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da" href="../../证据/87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>87cd0d7f2ace</small></a></details><details><summary>private static void ImageSourceChanged(</summary><p>SHA256 d3ed7ce6cca860ac89d671dc0fe4ee239a97063d18bed94d3ad97595d5d52555 / MVID 47136107-aecc-42c7-bdbd-a8641253cae6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="78da8122f6161c9aa648708613f025f50a4209a1f42aabe26f6c313a94a2e957" href="../../证据/78da8122f6161c9aa648708613f025f50a4209a1f42aabe26f6c313a94a2e957.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>78da8122f616</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::ClearImageView / 0x06000345</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a08ab0b721c33446e242502cf2c4106f1e0d38598500426ddc2f545580f7b747" href="../../证据/a08ab0b721c33446e242502cf2c4106f1e0d38598500426ddc2f545580f7b747.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a08ab0b721c3</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::RenderControlBase_Unloaded / 0x06000338</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d70a3f93d6248c0e21e63579ce85439cfe4021c3f9e5ea13e84e9afb111c08b3" href="../../证据/d70a3f93d6248c0e21e63579ce85439cfe4021c3f9e5ea13e84e9afb111c08b3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d70a3f93d624</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::DeInitRenderControl / 0x0600033c</summary><p>SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b970a4656f4def286a3239e695f0526a178ef6053f39264e9cc12eb5f24e58da" href="../../证据/b970a4656f4def286a3239e695f0526a178ef6053f39264e9cc12eb5f24e58da.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b970a4656f4d</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：不能仅凭选定体没有取消调用断言原程序全局不存在排空；进程/父窗口关闭及其它所有者仍需独立追踪。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：未观察原机清空/卸载与回调竞争，实际过期呈现、异常或内存滞留是否发生及概率均未知。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="DR02"><summary>DR02 · QueryModuleRecentlyResult批次容器 → ReleaseModuleHistoryResult → 原native释放请求</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>SDK查询把每页原始缓冲地址加入ls。容器Release把ls[i]复制为局部IntPtr后按ref交ModuleManager；成功时该callee只将局部ref置零，原ls元素并未因此更新。返回码未由容器检查，也未清列表，故不能声称重复Release安全或所有页已成功释放。实际native只读捕获，未重复释放。</p><p>representation：ls保留每页pstModuleResBuff；nNums/pPbResultList描述页</p><p>cache：按nTotalNum分页；无结果时Release已积累页后null</p><p>release：Release逐页调用；本体未Clear原ls，也未建立幂等状态</p><details><summary>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::QueryModuleRecentlyResult</summary><p>34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="67f9656efc1b40eb7fe42a6cb57203cf27cc468fec22d293f914cb7bb2030d78" href="../../证据/67f9656efc1b40eb7fe42a6cb57203cf27cc468fec22d293f914cb7bb2030d78.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>67f9656efc1b</small></a></details><details><summary>.IMVS_QUERY_MODULE_RES_INFO_LIST_Class::Release</summary><p>34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9f03818f554e4c7ce2911de021ac5ce97bbcf7c7fc1f039dea8a63d0445012a6" href="../../证据/9f03818f554e4c7ce2911de021ac5ce97bbcf7c7fc1f039dea8a63d0445012a6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9f03818f554e</small></a></details><details><summary>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::ReleaseModuleHistoryResult</summary><p>34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="673d8a9503f2cb3d5005fdf9f477d705ca956036da8370925e1b61ea4936faeb" href="../../证据/673d8a9503f2cb3d5005fdf9f477d705ca956036da8370925e1b61ea4936faeb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>673d8a9503f2</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：IMVS_ReleaseDynamicMemory内部、失败后重试/双释放行为和外层是否保证恰一次释放仍需原native/调用链证明。</p></details></details></article><article data-retirement-side="current"><h4>当前：独立实现</h4><p><strong>主窗关闭先等待活动流程与调试会话停下，再启动owner与scope退役。</strong></p><p><strong>谁持有：</strong>流程Task、独立调试session、回调队列、配置宿主与scope分别收尾。</p><p><strong>已确认的收尾：</strong>DrainWorkflowBeforeClose取消并等待activeRun换出，OnClosing等待调试session；OnClosed关闭owner/回调队列、关闭配置并Dispose scope。</p><p><strong>此后仍可能存在：</strong>OnClosed与切方案不同，该体没有逐清workflowSessions/results/configurationResults或所有控件图像。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：窗口关闭启动退役，不等于外部持有者、所有像素及原生资源已经同步归零。</p><details><summary>逐段展开成员、分支与源码</summary><details data-retirement-proof="CR06"><summary>CR06 · 切方案 / 关闭主窗 → 先阻止旧owner发布，scope等待租约；主窗关闭不等于全持有者清零</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>切方案ReplaceExecutionScope先使执行owner失效、取消当前请求，显式Clear调试记录、configurationResults、workflowSessions、results等，再Dispose旧scope并创建新scope。scope.Dispose先closing并Cancel，只有取消完成且leases==0才Release；Release清state/services/参数字典，再逐个Dispose可释放资源，失败资源额外存failedResources。主窗关闭与切方案不同：DrainWorkflowBeforeClose先取消活动流程并等activeRun换出；独立调试session由OnClosing等停。OnClosed关闭owner/回调队列、关配置并Dispose scope，但该体没有Clear workflowSessions/results/configurationResults或逐个清控件图像。只可说关闭启动退役，不能说所有外部对象已同步归零。</p><p>representation：scope的租约控制state/services清理；NodeRunRecord与WPF/工具显示引用不由同一引用计数统一管理。</p><p>cache：失败资源被保留用于CleanupFailures诊断；旧在飞方法局部引用、关闭窗口/context、外部消费者与结果Task可另外保持载荷可达。FrameworkRunHistory只存摘要（TD08），不能把它当图像历史释放机制。</p><p>release：新owner阻止旧结果进入新方案，但不是销毁所有旧像素；窗口生命周期、scope清理、查询容器释放和最后图像读者退出需分别说明。</p><details><summary> void ReplaceExecutionScope()</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="059edbdec78959762068e303ec96ee8bd8b5949dbf1185a4cdc704bd690f8403" href="../../证据/059edbdec78959762068e303ec96ee8bd8b5949dbf1185a4cdc704bd690f8403.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>059edbdec789</small></a></details><details><summary> public void Dispose(){</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4e8fd932d9bb3193cfa517bfb3fe01d6ac384e05ebb94607f447b5bf750a6daf" href="../../证据/4e8fd932d9bb3193cfa517bfb3fe01d6ac384e05ebb94607f447b5bf750a6daf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4e8fd932d9bb</small></a></details><details><summary> void Release(){</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b" href="../../证据/fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fbceb2ae3ec4</small></a></details><details><summary> void RecordCleanupFailure(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="667d84c52f018741334ebe41c9094af0e41b74238b795cd1b7c240d6bab018be" href="../../证据/667d84c52f018741334ebe41c9094af0e41b74238b795cd1b7c240d6bab018be.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>667d84c52f01</small></a></details><details><summary> async void DrainWorkflowBeforeClose(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6be2984eb8a0ced82e645ad5b341ff9f2eeff1bd91922706f00d68bb58b4a1fb" href="../../证据/6be2984eb8a0ced82e645ad5b341ff9f2eeff1bd91922706f00d68bb58b4a1fb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6be2984eb8a0</small></a></details><details><summary> protected override async void OnClosing(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f6d959502fe59ffd5b4afa4b8b044e17cc3b1da9af33f62790bf710c6339e797" href="../../证据/f6d959502fe59ffd5b4afa4b8b044e17cc3b1da9af33f62790bf710c6339e797.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f6d959502fe5</small></a></details><details><summary> protected override void OnClosed(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9244b0ac6bbc3cfbdf8dc4d39210323edbd9c04dc225ccac1177ba978d7fea8b" href="../../证据/9244b0ac6bbc3cfbdf8dc4d39210323edbd9c04dc225ccac1177ba978d7fea8b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9244b0ac6bbc</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：没有强制GC、原机内存峰值或最终外部读者测量；不得由静态Dispose路径推断释放的精确时刻、无泄漏或native等价。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="CR05"><summary>CR05 · 工具调试 / 普通配置自执行 / 关闭编辑器 → 停止调度与LastResult、Task结果、宿主缓存分别退役</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>当前实际类型是ToolDebugSession和ExecutionSessionResult，并未发现名为ToolExecutionSession/RunRecord的同一实体。ToolDebugSession.active保存Start返回的Task，完成finally仅清取消源/更新状态，不把active置null；若为RunOnce，该完成Task可继续持有NodeRunRecord直到active被下次Start替换或session不再可达。StopAsync取消并等待active，不清已保存结果。普通配置调度ToolConfigurationExecution.Dispatch开始把LastResult=null，完成再置结果；StopAsync只取消轮询并等loop，不清LastResult；DisposeAsync再等待inFlight也不清它。宿主RunConfiguredTool按owner/配置存活/节点身份准入后缓存record，不限成功状态；关闭配置可阻止晚发布，但CloseToolConfiguration没有清configurationResults。独立调试窗口的关闭另等待session.DisposeAsync后移除session集合项，不等同清宿主toolDebugRecords。</p><p>representation：完成Task&lt;T>、配置执行器LastResult、configurationResults、toolDebugRecords和工具窗口LastResult是独立持有者，不能统一命名成一个“会话结果”。</p><p>cache：正常失败record可覆盖配置缓存旧记录；配置失活导致不发布时旧configurationResults可留存。调试Invalidate还只做宿主特定失效标记，不消灭其它session旧引用。</p><p>release：停止、Dispose调度器、从窗口集合移除、清LastResult和清宿主记录是不同动作；不能从窗口关闭推断所有输出图像已释放。</p><details><summary> Task? active;</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5222f1b9a88904f5a5dd94c33435abff4b170b6f582a9d88d7307170b623d7e2" href="../../证据/5222f1b9a88904f5a5dd94c33435abff4b170b6f582a9d88d7307170b623d7e2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5222f1b9a889</small></a></details><details><summary>   async Task&lt;T> Execute()</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d22473d11e55a85136428f9e85871a4c9736e0216fcbf94f8a3303db959972b7" href="../../证据/d22473d11e55a85136428f9e85871a4c9736e0216fcbf94f8a3303db959972b7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d22473d11e55</small></a></details><details><summary> public async Task StopAsync()</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d03635ba61cc497e221d27abad4f95c8d21f7cb872d50b0fb5e6dd404ab34392" href="../../证据/d03635ba61cc497e221d27abad4f95c8d21f7cb872d50b0fb5e6dd404ab34392.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d03635ba61cc</small></a></details><details><summary> async Task Dispatch(){</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="17ad97750ddbdb1eca5d670992614b5fe04923e8de8d4a7bbbcd98abe89eaee7" href="../../证据/17ad97750ddbdb1eca5d670992614b5fe04923e8de8d4a7bbbcd98abe89eaee7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>17ad97750ddb</small></a></details><details><summary> public async Task StopAsync(){</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7c2e184d34c38dc51b4a341154c21fafa817e27a26c993f0044adab6a2445b38" href="../../证据/7c2e184d34c38dc51b4a341154c21fafa817e27a26c993f0044adab6a2445b38.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7c2e184d34c3</small></a></details><details><summary>  }catch(Exception ex){record=new(nodeId,</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="de435e16af18ef654977ecb4f322f199172aff53db1a457fbad80574ea25f742" href="../../证据/de435e16af18ef654977ecb4f322f199172aff53db1a457fbad80574ea25f742.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>de435e16af18</small></a></details><details><summary> void CloseToolConfiguration()</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4ae7013d1039c64b158076a59b90b6c4159192d58e7127db05904e773c209bde" href="../../证据/4ae7013d1039c64b158076a59b90b6c4159192d58e7127db05904e773c209bde.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4ae7013d1039</small></a></details><details><summary> void BindToolEditorLifetime(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="560abd8d493dc3cc55d6ab695ea2bd4fc81bd84bd083e5db864f3f7b81b9b5f6" href="../../证据/560abd8d493dc3cc55d6ab695ea2bd4fc81bd84bd083e5db864f3f7b81b9b5f6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>560abd8d493d</small></a></details><details><summary> void StoreToolDebugResult(</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f654b99be7096785ff5c4c306c63f24c34a67a6f083c5615d6e9f4840bb586e3" href="../../证据/f654b99be7096785ff5c4c306c63f24c34a67a6f083c5615d6e9f4840bb586e3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f654b99be709</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：Task对象是否实际继续可达取决于窗口/context/session持有；此处只指出字段可达链，不声称关闭后必然泄漏。工具窗口内部额外结果/图像字段仍按各工具另核。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="TD07"><summary>TD07 · IToolDisplayProvider.LastDisplay → 三presenter → frame持有 / 图像层位图 / 文本和结果投影</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>RefreshToolDisplay按请求代次、execution owner和当前流程判Current，先Show(null)清旧显示，再在node有结果且实现provider时取frame；Current通过后把同一frame传给图像、记录和结果列表presenter。图像presenter把Frame字段设为frame，清文字/几何children与旧image.Source/图像层，然后按选中图像和勾选层重建WPF图像。Bitmap辅助函数同样Pixels.ToArray→BitmapSource.Create→Freeze。记录presenter只取RecordText，列表presenter把ResultList投影为一个字典行；不能把这两者说成持有相同的整帧字段。</p><p>representation：image presenter.Frame保留完整ToolDisplayFrame；各图像层另有BitmapSource副本；TextBlock/表行是另一种投影。</p><p>cache：清frame后尺寸归1；provider可能仍持有最近输出。最多三勾选图像层及文字/图形按frame重建。</p><p>release：Show(null)置Frame=null并移除该presenter的图像/标签引用，不调用frame.Image.Dispose或清provider缓存；同一图像的其它持有者继续有效。</p><details><summary>long request=++toolDisplayRequestGeneration</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="011023208dd4062299060f59880a42a7b6c3a347c961a8082a16f314694d4cd0" href="../../证据/011023208dd4062299060f59880a42a7b6c3a347c961a8082a16f314694d4cd0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>011023208dd4</small></a></details><details><summary>Frame = frame; labels.Children.Clear(); image.Source = null;</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5c262edb8d5033f223006a465497bad17a1acb92da5c65898c4b6fe51b506a17" href="../../证据/5c262edb8d5033f223006a465497bad17a1acb92da5c65898c4b6fe51b506a17.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5c262edb8d50</small></a></details><details><summary>var selectedLayer=frame.SelectedImageName</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="187a9b03f59713dabc98ef98fbd993721025a132f378bb576a3df9eb4d8dbd02" href="../../证据/187a9b03f59713dabc98ef98fbd993721025a132f378bb576a3df9eb4d8dbd02.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>187a9b03f597</small></a></details><details><summary>public void Show(ToolDisplayFrame? frame) { Text</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d83ceb0af29dbefc84e08ee90d7f67f206a59ced14a87db29e445ec9f42c2cc" href="../../证据/0d83ceb0af29dbefc84e08ee90d7f67f206a59ced14a87db29e445ec9f42c2cc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d83ceb0af29</small></a></details><details><summary>Columns.Clear(); ItemsSource = null;</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f4570afb88fcff97092854091ef3fef6e654e2d4ab2518e002cc9add9732b19c" href="../../证据/f4570afb88fcff97092854091ef3fef6e654e2d4ab2518e002cc9add9732b19c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f4570afb88fc</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：不因Current门或Freeze推断所有生产者线程安全；原版文字/几何/native图像的最后读者和生命周期仍独立核对。</p></details><details data-retirement-proof="CSR04"><summary>CSR04 · 取消或资源Dispose异常后的root Dispose / Lease.Exit → root清理是一次性尝试；failedResources保留不等于排队重试</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Dispose设置closing后，stopping.Cancel抛Exception会RecordCleanupFailure(cancel,stopping,error)，finally仍设置cancellationComplete并TryRelease；不是因取消回调异常就跳过该finally。TryRelease要求closing、cancellationComplete、leases==0且!releaseStarted，在真正Release前置releaseStarted=true。Release对各IDisposable的Exception分别记录后继续下一资源，并单独尝试stopping.Dispose；这点现有CR06已有，本事实新增明确重试边界：root重复Dispose因closing立即return，后续Exit也因releaseStarted不再启动第二遍，failedResources只保留对象，所选类没有重试/清空该表的方法。</p><p>representation：CleanupFailures getter返回失败记录数组副本；内部failedResources保存真实资源引用。诊断快照与资源持有是两层。</p><p>cache：失败对象及其Exception可继续使资源图可达；保留到root仍可达不等于资源已释放，也不等于有后台重试任务。</p><p>release：Release前先清states/有效参数/services/ownedServices，失败不会把原索引恢复。普通单项Dispose抛Exception不会阻断后续项；但分配快照、RecordCleanupFailure自身异常或进程级故障等未被这一逐资源catch覆盖。</p><details><summary>Dispose cancellation catch and finally</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="02ecd73394adadcadbfe782f92e3631482ad988c312710e067cd96fb94f20b57" href="../../证据/02ecd73394adadcadbfe782f92e3631482ad988c312710e067cd96fb94f20b57.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>02ecd73394ad</small></a></details><details><summary>TryRelease once-only gate</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="72db19d30e20a46eec751d69f739869910654f19a0f7de0d83b7a4e63df74a60" href="../../证据/72db19d30e20a46eec751d69f739869910654f19a0f7de0d83b7a4e63df74a60.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>72db19d30e20</small></a></details><details><summary>Exit can trigger final release</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f8ca4e658a43e85ba68d55bf16d6ce8c43293c07089fdb1f9e2854aa5a3b34de" href="../../证据/f8ca4e658a43e85ba68d55bf16d6ce8c43293c07089fdb1f9e2854aa5a3b34de.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f8ca4e658a43</small></a></details><details><summary>Release catches each resource and token</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b" href="../../证据/fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fbceb2ae3ec4</small></a></details><details><summary>Diagnostic snapshot and actual failed object retention</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="62e552a2c3645bbeb9d712b2c3ae8d70a647bde8ebe5dfd80ae3d0cb5aceba9d" href="../../证据/62e552a2c3645bbeb9d712b2c3ae8d70a647bde8ebe5dfd80ae3d0cb5aceba9d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>62e552a2c364</small></a></details><details><summary>releaseStarted and closing fields</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="802be731c5ac6e255baee00602bf6d6a3680df36bfafa4d18628ba85983e0c72" href="../../证据/802be731c5ac6e255baee00602bf6d6a3680df36bfafa4d18628ba85983e0c72.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>802be731c5ac</small></a></details><details><summary>Lease exits once</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1e55e375b9038794e05eb7ab59d4278d46a36f4890c92dc633e436e1a3cdfa31" href="../../证据/1e55e375b9038794e05eb7ab59d4278d46a36f4890c92dc633e436e1a3cdfa31.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1e55e375b903</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：不把源码Exception catch扩大为任何OOM、进程退出或任意RecordCleanupFailure自身失败时也必完整清理。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：本条是源码静态事实；另列合成ScopeRetirementProbe验证有限异常与重复Dispose。GC、真实资源/GUI/设备及native释放未观测，不以幂等调用门推成功释放/原版等价。</p></details></details></article></div></details><details data-retirement-failures><summary>收尾失败怎么办？四个容易误判的异常分支</summary><article data-retirement-failure="replace-service"><h4>替换服务时，旧服务Dispose抛错会怎样？</h4><p>旧owned标记可能已撤，但services仍指旧对象，新服务未登记；这条失败不走root的CleanupFailures。</p><details data-retirement-proof="CSR01"><summary>CSR01 · ModuleExecutionScope.RegisterService&lt;T>替换旧owned服务 → 先撤owned标记，再Dispose；抛错可留下未回滚的旧映射</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>条件必须同时满足：同T已有previous、新service不是同引用、ownedServices.Remove(previous)返回true且previous实现IDisposable。该条件链先从ownedServices删除旧对象，再调用previous.Dispose；只有其正常返回才写services[typeof(T)]=新service及按owned标记登记新对象。旧Dispose抛异常时方法无catch/finally回滚：services仍映射旧previous，旧owned标记已移除，新service未写入，异常直接向调用者传播，也不调用RecordCleanupFailure。不能把注册失败描述为原状态完全不变。</p><p>representation：services以Type为key保留对象引用；ownedServices是按ReferenceEquality比较的跨Type集合。新旧服务引用与该集合标记分开。</p><p>cache：Service&lt;T>()仍可能查回旧previous。后续root Release的服务候选来自ownedServices而非services全值，所以若旧对象没有另在states等候选中，它不再因这个服务映射获得自动Dispose重试。另有state/服务别名时不能据这一条断言永不再被Dispose。</p><p>release：这是服务替换入口的异常合同，区别于root Release逐资源catch/记失败后继续；服务注册并未采用同样的失败资源保留策略。</p><details><summary>RegisterService&lt;T> mutation order</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ef79a5bdf89ba032cc80169004e45707f3f8da518d0b728d8b3d630f50e98eb5" href="../../证据/ef79a5bdf89ba032cc80169004e45707f3f8da518d0b728d8b3d630f50e98eb5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ef79a5bdf89b</small></a></details><details><summary>Service&lt;T> query</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a55462ac6451fc7c10fab1793f6eb70768b9c36f0d85e909505f02c4746e943d" href="../../证据/a55462ac6451fc7c10fab1793f6eb70768b9c36f0d85e909505f02c4746e943d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a55462ac6451</small></a></details><details><summary>Release candidate construction</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b" href="../../证据/fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fbceb2ae3ec4</small></a></details><details><summary>RecordCleanupFailure retention</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="667d84c52f018741334ebe41c9094af0e41b74238b795cd1b7c240d6bab018be" href="../../证据/667d84c52f018741334ebe41c9094af0e41b74238b795cd1b7c240d6bab018be.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>667d84c52f01</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：本条是源码静态事实；另列ScopeRetirementProbe验证有限合成Disposable替换异常。真实相机/工具服务、GUI与设备未观测，不直接宣称现有资源会触发。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：ownedServices按对象而非逐Type独立计数；所有多接口别名注册/外部所有者的实际组合未穷尽。</p></details></article><article data-retirement-failure="remove-node"><h4>一批节点里，第一个Dispose抛错会怎样？</h4><p>节点state与参数先移除才Dispose；首个异常可打断后续state裁剪，不能沿用root逐资源继续清理的保证。</p><details data-retirement-proof="CSR02"><summary>CSR02 · RemoveNode与RetainProcedureNodes批量裁剪 → 删除记录在Dispose之前完成；首个异常中断剩余裁剪</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>RemoveNode在root.gate内先删除effectiveParameters键，再从states.Remove取出value；离锁后仅当value实现IDisposable才Dispose，没有catch和RecordCleanupFailure。Dispose抛错时该node状态及参数已从这些字典移除，调用直接失败；重复RemoveNode找不到state就return，不自动重试旧对象。RetainProcedureNodes先批量删除不在keep中的全部参数键，再快照待移state键并foreach RemoveNode；其中一项抛错将中断剩余foreach，后续state仍可留在states，而其参数键可能已在第一阶段删除。</p><p>representation：节点状态字典移除、参数字典移除、对象Dispose完成分别发生，不能用一个成功/失败标记代替。</p><p>cache：没有被循环走到的state仍由root.states持有，可在之后的裁剪或root关闭进入其它清理；已移除但Dispose失败对象不由本分支自动放入failedResources。若它另被owned服务/外部持有，则还需单独判断。</p><p>release：单节点Remove/批量Retain与root Release有不同异常屏障；root Release的逐项继续保证不能外推到这两个入口。</p><details><summary>RemoveNode removes then disposes</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ff088aad88d8d8409e0a4d415d967d2fc4b0ac692180e6de62f6c72fa4d32e69" href="../../证据/ff088aad88d8d8409e0a4d415d967d2fc4b0ac692180e6de62f6c72fa4d32e69.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ff088aad88d8</small></a></details><details><summary>RetainProcedureNodes two-phase pruning</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fd003545d04d7cbe309b8965e71c44483cfb2bdcf37af963fb6bf3978a7ab2ac" href="../../证据/fd003545d04d7cbe309b8965e71c44483cfb2bdcf37af963fb6bf3978a7ab2ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fd003545d04d</small></a></details><details><summary>WPF RetainExecutionNodes caller</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="649bacd49f444bba56b31e370305693a6359a602663d27765cad1dce2840a31b" href="../../证据/649bacd49f444bba56b31e370305693a6359a602663d27765cad1dce2840a31b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>649bacd49f44</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：WPF doc.Changed等上层对传播异常如何显示/恢复需按调用者另追；本切片不宣称文档编辑或整个solution关闭必然失败。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：另列合成ScopeRetirementProbe已观测有限顺序Remove/Retain异常；并发与真实资源异常未观测，本条仍按源码关系取证。</p></details></article><article data-retirement-failure="closing-access"><h4>closing是不是所有入口都关闭？</h4><p>State/Enter和参数入口有自己的拒绝门；Service查询等入口不一定共用该门。租约只保护root Release，不能外推所有Remove。</p><details data-retirement-proof="CSR03"><summary>CSR03 · root closing置位与API准入 / 租约 → 立即拒新状态与租约，不等于所有查询/删除都禁用</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>root Dispose在gate下先设置closing=true再调用stopping.Cancel；State&lt;T>、RegisterService、Enter与参数Parameters入口均以closing抛ObjectDisposedException。与之不同，Service&lt;T>只锁gate查询，无closing检查：若活跃租约阻止Release清字典，它仍可在closing期间返回旧服务；Release清空后则返回null。ForProcedure只验证procedure字符串，可以继续生成borrowed view；RequestRun/RequestRefresh在closing直接返回。RemoveNode与RetainProcedureNodes没有closing或leases门，故root完整Release等待租约不能被概括成任何节点移除/替换都受同一租约保护。</p><p>representation：closing是操作级准入状态；cancellationComplete与leases控制root Release时机。借用view的存在本身不证明其API可继续使用。</p><p>cache：在Release前states/services可能仍保留；State即使只是想取已有值也先拒绝，Service查询则未使用同样策略。</p><p>release：Enter取得的Lease仅参与root TryRelease；Lease自身Interlocked.Exchange确保一次Exit。它不替代调用者在RemoveNode等入口的并发协调。</p><details><summary>State&lt;T> closing gate</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b70c7dfc27c1831ec0c54986c719bacb2e6064766684a2425b3188e5d8c7446c" href="../../证据/b70c7dfc27c1831ec0c54986c719bacb2e6064766684a2425b3188e5d8c7446c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b70c7dfc27c1</small></a></details><details><summary>RegisterService and Service asymmetry</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b3568c9a7737fce55bd04f55f551e668924c85e43e247aa44d896525d087131e" href="../../证据/b3568c9a7737fce55bd04f55f551e668924c85e43e247aa44d896525d087131e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b3568c9a7737</small></a></details><details><summary>ForProcedure borrowed view construction</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9af9ceff47aa44aa1272f50a0c6141d393421d9080eb4221f686ec047ef1f97d" href="../../证据/9af9ceff47aa44aa1272f50a0c6141d393421d9080eb4221f686ec047ef1f97d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9af9ceff47aa</small></a></details><details><summary>RequestRun and RequestRefresh closing return</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="07915e3685efb2856e87527487a856905e5a7d0e119618882b5cfead1b861932" href="../../证据/07915e3685efb2856e87527487a856905e5a7d0e119618882b5cfead1b861932.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>07915e3685ef</small></a></details><details><summary>Enter and RemoveNode guards differ</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="107ef872276da6c4d33e93d24646cc63e010650c4331e482387587e321c05994" href="../../证据/107ef872276da6c4d33e93d24646cc63e010650c4331e482387587e321c05994.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>107ef872276d</small></a></details><details><summary>Dispose/TryRelease/Exit</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4e8fd932d9bb3193cfa517bfb3fe01d6ac384e05ebb94607f447b5bf750a6daf" href="../../证据/4e8fd932d9bb3193cfa517bfb3fe01d6ac384e05ebb94607f447b5bf750a6daf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4e8fd932d9bb</small></a></details><details><summary>Effective parameter closing gate</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0b3d70d24c37752cfb43fca518915b9c500c26d7db1a300a2a2d4d57c0808956" href="../../证据/0b3d70d24c37752cfb43fca518915b9c500c26d7db1a300a2a2d4d57c0808956.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0b3d70d24c37</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：代码未给出所有方法的全域并发安全保证；不将允许调用某查询/Remove的事实解释为对资源在用状态必然安全。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：stopping.Token在CancellationTokenSource已Dispose之后的外部访问合同未在这里运行验证，不作应用级行为推断。</p></details></article><article data-retirement-failure="retry"><h4>再调用Dispose会自动重试失败资源吗？</h4><p>不会。closing/releaseStarted已置位，failedResources保留失败对象供诊断，源码没有把它作为自动重试队列。</p><details data-retirement-proof="CSR04"><summary>CSR04 · 取消或资源Dispose异常后的root Dispose / Lease.Exit → root清理是一次性尝试；failedResources保留不等于排队重试</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Dispose设置closing后，stopping.Cancel抛Exception会RecordCleanupFailure(cancel,stopping,error)，finally仍设置cancellationComplete并TryRelease；不是因取消回调异常就跳过该finally。TryRelease要求closing、cancellationComplete、leases==0且!releaseStarted，在真正Release前置releaseStarted=true。Release对各IDisposable的Exception分别记录后继续下一资源，并单独尝试stopping.Dispose；这点现有CR06已有，本事实新增明确重试边界：root重复Dispose因closing立即return，后续Exit也因releaseStarted不再启动第二遍，failedResources只保留对象，所选类没有重试/清空该表的方法。</p><p>representation：CleanupFailures getter返回失败记录数组副本；内部failedResources保存真实资源引用。诊断快照与资源持有是两层。</p><p>cache：失败对象及其Exception可继续使资源图可达；保留到root仍可达不等于资源已释放，也不等于有后台重试任务。</p><p>release：Release前先清states/有效参数/services/ownedServices，失败不会把原索引恢复。普通单项Dispose抛Exception不会阻断后续项；但分配快照、RecordCleanupFailure自身异常或进程级故障等未被这一逐资源catch覆盖。</p><details><summary>Dispose cancellation catch and finally</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="02ecd73394adadcadbfe782f92e3631482ad988c312710e067cd96fb94f20b57" href="../../证据/02ecd73394adadcadbfe782f92e3631482ad988c312710e067cd96fb94f20b57.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>02ecd73394ad</small></a></details><details><summary>TryRelease once-only gate</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="72db19d30e20a46eec751d69f739869910654f19a0f7de0d83b7a4e63df74a60" href="../../证据/72db19d30e20a46eec751d69f739869910654f19a0f7de0d83b7a4e63df74a60.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>72db19d30e20</small></a></details><details><summary>Exit can trigger final release</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f8ca4e658a43e85ba68d55bf16d6ce8c43293c07089fdb1f9e2854aa5a3b34de" href="../../证据/f8ca4e658a43e85ba68d55bf16d6ce8c43293c07089fdb1f9e2854aa5a3b34de.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f8ca4e658a43</small></a></details><details><summary>Release catches each resource and token</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b" href="../../证据/fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fbceb2ae3ec4</small></a></details><details><summary>Diagnostic snapshot and actual failed object retention</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="62e552a2c3645bbeb9d712b2c3ae8d70a647bde8ebe5dfd80ae3d0cb5aceba9d" href="../../证据/62e552a2c3645bbeb9d712b2c3ae8d70a647bde8ebe5dfd80ae3d0cb5aceba9d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>62e552a2c364</small></a></details><details><summary>releaseStarted and closing fields</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="802be731c5ac6e255baee00602bf6d6a3680df36bfafa4d18628ba85983e0c72" href="../../证据/802be731c5ac6e255baee00602bf6d6a3680df36bfafa4d18628ba85983e0c72.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>802be731c5ac</small></a></details><details><summary>Lease exits once</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1e55e375b9038794e05eb7ab59d4278d46a36f4890c92dc633e436e1a3cdfa31" href="../../证据/1e55e375b9038794e05eb7ab59d4278d46a36f4890c92dc633e436e1a3cdfa31.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1e55e375b903</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：不把源码Exception catch扩大为任何OOM、进程退出或任意RecordCleanupFailure自身失败时也必完整清理。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：本条是源码静态事实；另列合成ScopeRetirementProbe验证有限异常与重复Dispose。GC、真实资源/GUI/设备及native释放未观测，不以幂等调用门推成功释放/原版等价。</p></details></article></details><details data-scope-retirement-probe><summary>当前框架合成实测：12项异常检查</summary><p>仅执行已编译ModuleExecutionScope与合成资源，不是五种真实UI操作、原版、设备或整条图像链的验收。没有重建产品项目。</p><details data-scope-probe-case="replacement.partial-state"><summary>服务替换失败后的映射与拥有标记</summary><p>Failed service replacement keeps the old mapping after removing its owned marker</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4273e0c3f525bce358987dd08c27fff85cce7360fa4933c452645417b49b95b8" href="../../证据/4273e0c3f525bce358987dd08c27fff85cce7360fa4933c452645417b49b95b8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4273e0c3f525</small></a></details><details data-scope-probe-case="replacement.no-retry"><summary>旧拥有标记移除后，root关闭不重试该服务</summary><p>Root close does not retry this removed service ownership marker</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8d492db79ac959062e68bb3d5afc7792fc54be18d300f07dc4d785c7f34fee1c" href="../../证据/8d492db79ac959062e68bb3d5afc7792fc54be18d300f07dc4d785c7f34fee1c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8d492db79ac9</small></a></details><details data-scope-probe-case="remove.removed-before-error"><summary>RemoveNode先移状态再传播Dispose异常</summary><p>RemoveNode propagates failure after removing the old state</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c9d8fa4aece0d61096946ed6fa0b53e955cfe3685ce86966f711f6e4a6c6f016" href="../../证据/c9d8fa4aece0d61096946ed6fa0b53e955cfe3685ce86966f711f6e4a6c6f016.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c9d8fa4aece0</small></a></details><details data-scope-probe-case="remove.root-close"><summary>后续root关闭只清当前替换state</summary><p>Root close disposes the current replacement rather than retrying the removed object</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5405aa9d1847ba4b8038c20a3ac5f750ad4b94789682cd7f7218ea7eaec93062" href="../../证据/5405aa9d1847ba4b8038c20a3ac5f750ad4b94789682cd7f7218ea7eaec93062.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5405aa9d1847</small></a></details><details data-scope-probe-case="retain.first-error"><summary>首个异常中断批量state裁剪</summary><p>RetainProcedureNodes stops at the observed first disposal failure, leaving the later state</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bf8f617f3d4160e682d5c33ee670c143774a014fbe86c231b6fe594f7479dd75" href="../../证据/bf8f617f3d4160e682d5c33ee670c143774a014fbe86c231b6fe594f7479dd75.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bf8f617f3d41</small></a></details><details data-scope-probe-case="retain.later-root-close"><summary>剩余state可由后续root关闭退役</summary><p>The remaining state can be retired by a later root close</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fa067bc4cd69c4066e591dfbc7859e215466593053c692fadc94821b2d9984cc" href="../../证据/fa067bc4cd69c4066e591dfbc7859e215466593053c692fadc94821b2d9984cc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fa067bc4cd69</small></a></details><details data-scope-probe-case="closing.before-lease-exit"><summary>有租约时closing拒绝State/Enter但仍可查服务</summary><p>Closing rejects State and Enter while a live lease keeps the old service queryable</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dea64b7f463482e834ea005d3033c23076b34b296bfef8530e597fddfa653080" href="../../证据/dea64b7f463482e834ea005d3033c23076b34b296bfef8530e597fddfa653080.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dea64b7f4634</small></a></details><details data-scope-probe-case="closing.after-lease-exit"><summary>最后租约退出后释放state与服务</summary><p>Final lease exit releases both state and owned service and clears lookup</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bb210a24cfb72a71d522290e2290a653cd8367dabd7dbc5b064c1d536b158f43" href="../../证据/bb210a24cfb72a71d522290e2290a653cd8367dabd7dbc5b064c1d536b158f43.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bb210a24cfb7</small></a></details><details data-scope-probe-case="closing.idempotent-exit"><summary>重复Dispose不再次执行退役</summary><p>Repeated lease and root Dispose do not run release again</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c8e0c44c02c8baa3ffab6216dcb3b8d7ae64f30ebb7a0d0cc6a962369f2fa034" href="../../证据/c8e0c44c02c8baa3ffab6216dcb3b8d7ae64f30ebb7a0d0cc6a962369f2fa034.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c8e0c44c02c8</small></a></details><details data-scope-probe-case="release.continue-after-errors"><summary>取消回调与资源抛错后仍继续后续资源</summary><p>Cancellation callback and one resource failure do not prevent the later resource disposal</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cb055d2f695621b981102e0842498829663719e61774e0a4f456b43d318ecccd" href="../../证据/cb055d2f695621b981102e0842498829663719e61774e0a4f456b43d318ecccd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cb055d2f6956</small></a></details><details data-scope-probe-case="release.failed-holders"><summary>失败资源及取消源被诊断列表持有</summary><p>Private failedResources retains the actual failed resource plus cancellation source</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bcbaf06b65579afdc7269ece7be99b8dcc3d2acedb52d4218c944d5fbd9d3d4f" href="../../证据/bcbaf06b65579afdc7269ece7be99b8dcc3d2acedb52d4218c944d5fbd9d3d4f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bcbaf06b6557</small></a></details><details data-scope-probe-case="release.no-retry"><summary>重复root.Dispose保留诊断但不重试</summary><p>Repeated root Dispose preserves diagnostics without retrying failed cleanup</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8d1594423983a0d09424c5d829c1614e71bbc2e98a8ec689eb60d12f26b98150" href="../../证据/8d1594423983a0d09424c5d829c1614e71bbc2e98a8ec689eb60d12f26b98150.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8d1594423983</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">Only the previously compiled current ModuleExecutionScope is exercised with synthetic IDisposable resources and a synthetic throwing cancellation callback; no vendor/native runtime, real camera/tool resource, GUI or device.</p><p class="dd-gap">Read-only reflection observes ownedServices and failedResources to distinguish ownership markers from service lookup; no private field is changed.</p><p class="dd-gap">Local variables and audit observations intentionally retain synthetic resources. This does not measure last-owner release, GC, unmanaged pixel retirement or memory peaks.</p><p class="dd-gap">The two-state Retain order is observed for this finite runtime and setup; it does not establish a universal Dictionary/disposal ordering contract.</p><p class="dd-gap">No concurrency race, process-failure, OOM or exception thrown by the diagnostic recorder itself is injected.</p><p class="dd-gap">HintPath references reuse the GroupDataProbe production DLL bytes. This project has no ProjectReference and does not rebuild product assemblies; PE/PDB/source checksum identities are checked separately.</p><details><summary>本次实际加载的程序集、PDB与49份编译源码身份</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="642dd09f2365e9ef4de8df5efb2bd859cd429c33c63a5e759688380703f30fb4" href="../../证据/642dd09f2365e9ef4de8df5efb2bd859cd429c33c63a5e759688380703f30fb4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>642dd09f2365</small></a></details></details><details data-original-retirement-caller><summary>原版显示退役：已找到直接调用者，保留更外层断点</summary><p>Release包装控件Dispose → MainViewControl.Dispose → ModuleSource=null，随后清Content。此处只闭合直接调用；不把XAML中存在控件当作每次切方案都会调用Dispose的证明。</p><p>最初三个PE的5630个方法中未见直接引用；扩大到Release层后找到实际调用。有限检索未命中不能当作调用者不存在。</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d8bc231f67dc4f469fcd520f65e647ff6de3122a07c973aafc6092adf74b98df" href="../../证据/d8bc231f67dc4f469fcd520f65e647ff6de3122a07c973aafc6092adf74b98df.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d8bc231f67dc</small></a></details><details data-outer-retirement-audit><summary>主窗关闭的外层链：哪些已确认，哪个连接仍未知？</summary><article><h4>Shell Closing registration and accepted close branch</h4><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ShowMainWindow subscribes MainWindow_Closing; Add/RemoveMainWindowClosingHandle explicitly modify the same event. MainWindow_Closing assigns e.Cancel=Program.IsCancelClose(); only !e.Cancel invokes the IApplicationOperation service Dispose and then Environment.Exit(0). This is a service-interface call, not proof of Release control IDisposable dispatch.</p><details><summary>internal static void ShowMainWindow()</summary><p>retained-original-managed-decompiled-body; raw selected CIL separately retained</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9d501216b30740be7a65e2babcb8d77d2a4690d228adf79b2d5b27bede8b517e" href="../../证据/9d501216b30740be7a65e2babcb8d77d2a4690d228adf79b2d5b27bede8b517e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9d501216b307</small></a></details><details><summary>internal static void AddMainWindowClosingHandle()</summary><p>retained-original-managed-decompiled-body; raw selected CIL separately retained</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="eee24d69827065043a0f2897f69393cd34aff17a6301059f84be01d1967c6743" href="../../证据/eee24d69827065043a0f2897f69393cd34aff17a6301059f84be01d1967c6743.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>eee24d698270</small></a></details><details><summary>internal static void RemoveMainWindowClosingHandle()</summary><p>retained-original-managed-decompiled-body; raw selected CIL separately retained</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="118308f87fee59e1c7db858c5f6ee42cb9c5260247cea7b4ba2e689ad19358a7" href="../../证据/118308f87fee59e1c7db858c5f6ee42cb9c5260247cea7b4ba2e689ad19358a7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>118308f87fee</small></a></details><details><summary>private static void MainWindow_Closing(</summary><p>retained-original-managed-decompiled-body; raw selected CIL separately retained</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5fcf4e0a20e12a3ce6f8f9bc7f376028d39370498dc817881244011a6ce64d68" href="../../证据/5fcf4e0a20e12a3ce6f8f9bc7f376028d39370498dc817881244011a6ce64d68.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5fcf4e0a20e1</small></a></details><details><summary>public void RegisterMainWindow(</summary><p>retained-original-managed-decompiled-body; raw selected CIL separately retained</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="87018a82f162d94e3bd161404391480a23635ee9d02a0c94f8dd43bbc8879995" href="../../证据/87018a82f162d94e3bd161404391480a23635ee9d02a0c94f8dd43bbc8879995.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>87018a82f162</small></a></details><details><summary>public void ReplaceMainWindow(</summary><p>retained-original-managed-decompiled-body; raw selected CIL separately retained</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0794d07f0ccffc1b0b8cb0347c272cbe7cb0165ef3998580d087376a93a67aa9" href="../../证据/0794d07f0ccffc1b0b8cb0347c272cbe7cb0165ef3998580d087376a93a67aa9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0794d07f0ccf</small></a></details><details><summary>public void UnRegisterMainWindow(</summary><p>retained-original-managed-decompiled-body; raw selected CIL separately retained</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b652b0bc4da2e14c650592d073f1beaef4e8ccab984370615f5ef1c5ae3a1f55" href="../../证据/b652b0bc4da2e14c650592d073f1beaef4e8ccab984370615f5ef1c5ae3a1f55.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b652b0bc4da2</small></a></details><details><summary>public void Dispose()</summary><p>retained-original-managed-decompiled-body; raw selected CIL separately retained</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2b20a631e63b9e4ff8aabc234c4f00898d681eeaa12f6e6b3fcef4651582b31b" href="../../证据/2b20a631e63b9e4ff8aabc234c4f00898d681eeaa12f6e6b3fcef4651582b31b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2b20a631e63b</small></a></details></article><article><h4>ApplicationOperation.Dispose and MainWindowData.DoClose</h4><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ApplicationOperation.Dispose invokes Program.MainData.DoClose before WatchDog disposal, ShieldModuleCbResult and VmSolution.Dispose background-dependent branch. The selected DoClose body only removes eight VmSolution event subscriptions. No wrapper/image Dispose edge is introduced from these local bodies.</p><details><summary>public void Dispose()</summary><p>retained-original-managed-decompiled-body; raw selected CIL separately retained</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2b20a631e63b9e4ff8aabc234c4f00898d681eeaa12f6e6b3fcef4651582b31b" href="../../证据/2b20a631e63b9e4ff8aabc234c4f00898d681eeaa12f6e6b3fcef4651582b31b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2b20a631e63b</small></a></details><details><summary>public void DoClose()</summary><p>retained-original-managed-decompiled-body; raw selected CIL separately retained</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ceb60186857c3b63a59e99af370808092ec1369239f6164784fcf0330d698c22" href="../../证据/ceb60186857c3b63a59e99af370808092ec1369239f6164784fcf0330d698c22.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ceb60186857c</small></a></details></article><article><h4>Release Unloaded and explicit Dispose are distinct entry points</h4><p>source-confirmed</p><p>Release constructor subscribes Unloaded to VmMainViewConfigControl_Unloaded. That handler removes solution event subscriptions. Explicit Dispose calls this handler, unregisters RestoreDefaultDisplay, then mainViewControl?.Dispose and Content=null. An Unloaded event therefore does not by itself prove execution of explicit Dispose. MainWindow Window_Closed and BaseWindow_Closing retained bodies are empty.</p><details><summary>public VmMainViewConfigControl()</summary><p>retained-original-managed-decompiled-body; raw selected CIL separately retained</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="423ef606b0cbaa93bd04f46f0cef3ea9f1833022384fdbcb0cf1d2031e62061a" href="../../证据/423ef606b0cbaa93bd04f46f0cef3ea9f1833022384fdbcb0cf1d2031e62061a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>423ef606b0cb</small></a></details><details><summary>private void VmMainViewConfigControl_Unloaded(</summary><p>retained-original-managed-decompiled-body; raw selected CIL separately retained</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="93df80b12c8a40ba21b1b8349f9e811490a65e2c4ffacf5ff6c68e7f02b4724b" href="../../证据/93df80b12c8a40ba21b1b8349f9e811490a65e2c4ffacf5ff6c68e7f02b4724b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>93df80b12c8a</small></a></details><details><summary>public void Dispose()</summary><p>retained-original-managed-decompiled-body; raw selected CIL separately retained</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="510fde05ed592045cf3d6b1259ba7850a4277522c69577542122d3d71c4a48f5" href="../../证据/510fde05ed592045cf3d6b1259ba7850a4277522c69577542122d3d71c4a48f5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>510fde05ed59</small></a></details><details><summary>private void Window_Closed(</summary><p>retained-original-managed-decompiled-body; raw selected CIL separately retained</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1e073d32adc0236746f7195dd1957e7b90f7c88691cef6051c6d32c6e38616ee" href="../../证据/1e073d32adc0236746f7195dd1957e7b90f7c88691cef6051c6d32c6e38616ee.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1e073d32adc0</small></a></details><details><summary>private void BaseWindow_Closing(</summary><p>retained-original-managed-decompiled-body; raw selected CIL separately retained</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="15d6b73018cb826d4fbbb1e978ea61ba8a771055289fd3678464e073f06562c5" href="../../证据/15d6b73018cb826d4fbbb1e978ea61ba8a771055289fd3678464e073f06562c5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>15d6b73018cb</small></a></details></article><p class="dd-gap">{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;OCU01&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;outer caller → VMControls.WPF.Release.VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose&quot;,&quot;question&quot;:&quot;No direct wrapper Dispose operand found within these four original PEs; this finite negative scan does not prove no caller exists. Interface receiver identity, reflection/dynamic calls, other assemblies and host-specific invocation remain unresolved.&quot;}</p><p class="dd-gap">{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;OCU02&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;shell shutdown → final image readers&quot;,&quot;question&quot;:&quot;ApplicationOperation service Dispose, SDK destruction and process exit are not a proven structured call into Release.Dispose; cannot claim managed display payload disposal, in-flight task drain or final pixel reader release.&quot;}</p><details><summary>有限扫描范围、原字节身份与候选</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="45f04a3b8a99aa9976e631db63ed1964461374b3e3bd72e71e8f040780763659" href="../../证据/45f04a3b8a99aa9976e631db63ed1964461374b3e3bd72e71e8f040780763659.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>45f04a3b8a99</small></a></details></details></section></div></main><footer class="site-footer"><nav><a href="../index.html">首页／界面入口</a><a href="../主题/主界面入口.html">主界面</a><a href="../工具/index.html">工具窗口</a><a href="../数据/index.html">数据与 Owner</a><a href="../主题/执行与状态.html">执行与结果</a><a href="../清单/交付与兼容.html">范围／兼容</a></nav><p class="site-progress">文档分页不增加产品实施完成数。主框架口径：41/96＝42.71%；本批实施增量 0。</p></footer><script src="../公共资源/routes.js"></script><script src="../公共资源/site.js"></script></body></html>